        "summary": "pics and brochure",
        "subject": "pics and brochure",
        "details": "Hi Jahan\r\n\r\nAttached are pics and brochure with services, I am also a Decreed BSEE with an MBA, and certified in Home Inspection, my primary sub is a Master Painter ran his own business for 15 years.\r\n\r\nCraig Offutt\r\n314-616-0794 MOBILE\r\nC&C Concerns Inc.\r\nDMC\r\nRELIABLE SERVICES",
