        "summary": "Other changes for the home page",
        "subject": "Other changes for the home page",
        "details": "Home page changes only:\r\n\r\n\r\n  1.\r\nChange the background pic to the pic sent in the previous email of the sunset.\r\n  2.\r\nTake off \"Prices starting at.....\"\r\n  3.\r\nAdd \"Book 7 Nights.....Only Pay for 6\"  OR \"Stay a Week....On Us, Book 7 nights, 7th night is free.\"\r\nUnder this add \"More Sunset, More Beach Walks, More Memories\"\r\n  4.\r\nUnder \"About Us\" Add what I had sent you earlier in an email about myself and add the family picture with that.\r\n  5.\r\nTake the 2 unit pics off and the part about newly remodeled 2024- 2025.  We can add that on individual units if it applies to a unit.\r\n  6.\r\nAdd my email contact \"mlr@rpoflou.com\r\n  7.\r\nWhy Choose:  add what I sent earlier in an email.  Take off the 3 blue boxes that don't really apply to Blue Surf specifically.\r\n  8.\r\nOur Benefits:  add what I sent you earlier in an email.\r\n  9.\r\nAlso add: \"About Your Visit\"  this is the attachment in the email that I sent that has the things to expect (i.e. you have to be over 25 yrs old, no smoking, etc)\r\n  10.\r\nUnder \"Rates and Pricing\"  take off the 2 pics with the 1 and 2 bdrm links.  Only keep the wording that you have there now.\r\n  11.\r\nUnder \"Sales and Discounts\"  Keep what you have about contacting me for seasonal discounts. Add the part again about booking 7 nights/ 7th night free (with one of the catchy lines I told you earlier) Take the pics of the units off.\r\n  12.\r\nUnder \"Accommodation\"  add this final saying for the home page \"\r\n\r\nBlue Surf offers unbeatable Gulf views, easy beach access just steps away, and a peaceful, boutique atmosphere with only 34 townhomes. It\u2019s the perfect blend of relaxation, walkable dining, and family-friendly comfort \u2014 all in one of the best locations in Miramar Beach. \ud83c\udf0a\u2600\ufe0f\r\n\r\nI am going to gather some other pics for you to put randomly on the home page.  The unit you added the pics of is probably one of our most dated units to put a picture of on the website.\r\n\r\nI will send those to you tmrw, once I get a chance to go through some of them.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThank You,\r\n\r\nMichelle Richardson\r\nRichardson Properties, Inc.\r\nDavid Richardson Builder, Inc.",
