        "details": "Hey ??Jahan,\r\n\r\nLet\u2019s be honest.\r\n\r\nMost men will never experience this.\r\n\r\nThey\u2019ll finally make a good amount of money but then\u2026\r\n\r\nThey stay in the same place.\r\nThey keep having the same conversations.\r\nAnd they keep settling; for mediocre friendships, average women, and forgettable weekends.\r\n\r\nBut deep down. We want more.\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ve always wanted more.\r\n\r\nMore growth.\r\n\r\nMore connection.\r\n\r\nMore adventure.\r\n\r\nMore \r\n\r\n**life.**\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s what \r\n\r\n**Juno**is.\r\n\r\nNot a vacation.\r\nNot a mastermind.\r\nNot a party.\r\n\r\nA lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWe already ran one experience in Costa Rica (you can see a taste of it here: https://instagram.com/juno_destinations **instagram.com/juno_destinations** http://instagram.com/juno_destinations).\r\n\r\nAnd that\u2019s just the beginning.\r\n\r\nW\r\n\r\n**e\u2019re opening the next one in Turks and Caicos\u00a0**\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s not for everyone. If you are satisfied with average, don\u2019t waste your time.\u00a0\r\n\r\nBut if you\u2019re a high-performing entrepreneur or executive, and you\u2019re ready to be surrounded by men who get it and women who want it, while living the kind of life most only dream about\u2026\r\n\r\n&#128073; Apply here:**https://form.typeform.com/to/JbDvNvya** https://form.typeform.com/to/JbDvNv\r\n\r\nColin\r\n\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/colin.dingelstad/reels/ \r\n\r\nMentors of Mentors, Meestersweg 6, 6071BN Swalmen, The Netherlands\r\nNo longer interested in using viral videos to build your influence?\r\nYou can unsubscribe http://mentorsofmentors.activehosted.com/proc.php?nl=6&c=210&m=333&s=55f4bee756905bca3072c420f5c40527&act=unsub to stop receiving these emails.\r\n\r\nhttps://mentorsofmentors.store/2-step-system-new-years-discount",
