        "details": "**\u201cJust be yourself\u201d** to go viral they say.\r\n\r\nBut who you are with\u2026\r\n\r\nYour kids.\r\n\r\nYour clients.\r\n\r\nYour significant other.\r\n\r\nYour friends.\r\n\r\n\u2026isn\u2019t the same person. And it \r\n\r\n**shouldn\u2019t** be.\r\n\r\nSo when it comes to creating viral content, you get to choose your persona. You don\u2019t want to be fake. But you also don\u2019t want to be boring.\r\n\r\nWant an easy shortcut? Steal inspiration.\r\n\r\nNot from one person\u2014but from two or three.\r\n\r\nHere are some creative ways people have gone viral\u2014without just \u201cbeing themselves\u201d:\r\n\r\nJump rope transformation \u2013 **https://www.instagram.com/p/DENlNyHMFSf/** https://www.instagram.com/p/DENlNyHMFSf/\r\n\r\nBreaking down female health research \u2013 **https://www.instagram.com/reel/C9xkStGtWTp/** https://www.instagram.com/reel/C9xkStGtWTp/\u00a0\r\n\r\nFinding people\u2019s heights \u2013 **https://www.instagram.com/reel/DE7qPIvR6_T/** https://www.instagram.com/reel/DE7qPIvR6_T/\u00a0\r\n\r\nPhysics calculations \u2013 **https://www.instagram.com/reel/C-MHLTevMWA/** https://www.instagram.com/reel/C-MHLTevMWA/\u00a0\r\n\r\nStructural engineer analysis \u2013 **https://www.instagram.com/reel/DC34YIOuvBE/** https://www.instagram.com/reel/DC34YIOuvBE/\r\n\r\nDoctor reacts \u2013 **https://www.instagram.com/p/DD-BjfRvsMz/** https://www.instagram.com/p/DD-BjfRvsMz/\r\n\r\nReaction to \u2018expert\u2019 \u2013 **https://www.youtube.com/shorts/rdlMK2nx2Zk** https://www.youtube.com/shorts/rdlMK2nx2Zk\r\n\r\nDeadpan sarcasm \u2013 **https://www.youtube.com/shorts/t2xpkcrTYlw** https://www.youtube.com/shorts/t2xpkcrTYlw\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u2018Aha\u2019 podcast \u2013 **https://www.instagram.com/reel/DF3gIuqOIqF/** https://www.instagram.com/reel/DF3gIuqOIqF/\r\n\r\nScroll through Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts, and you\u2019ll see it everywhere. Creators take an existing concept\u2014and \r\n\r\n**put their own spin on it**.\u00a0\r\n\r\n**Now, it\u2019s your turn.\u00a0**\r\n\r\nWant help crafting your first viral content ideas? Reply and I\u2019ll help you brainstorm.\r\n\r\nColin\r\n\r\n&#128640; \r\n\r\n**Want to Go Viral?**\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\r\nThe videos we\u2019ve created have racked up \r\n\r\n**over 348 years** of total watch time\u2014learn from our viral editor video here. https://mentorsofmentors.com/step/store-checkout-01-2-2/\r\n\r\n&#127916; \r\n\r\n**Your First Viral Video?**\r\n\r\nJoin our group coaching and unlock done-with-you step-by-step guidance to create content that explodes. Reply for more info.\r\n\r\n\u26a1 \r\n\r\n**Skip the Guesswork\u2014DFY Service**\r\n\r\nOur team scripts, edits, and optimizes videos, so you can focus on growing, not guessing. Reply and we can book a time to talk.\r\n\r\n&#128172; \r\n\r\n**Got a Question About Going Viral?**\r\n\r\nHit reply! I\u2019ll answer them in future emails.\r\n\r\n&#128200; \r\n\r\n**Watch Me Go From 0 to 100K Followers**\r\n\r\nSee me grow an Instagram account from scratch. Watch in real time.\r\n&#128073; Follow Colin https://www.instagram.com/colin.dingelstad/reels/\r\n\r\n****\r\n\r\nStill Reading? You Might Just Be My FavoriteLook at you, scrolling down like a detective on a mission. Whether you\u2019re incredibly thorough, a little nosy, or just really good at procrastinating, I appreciate your curiosity.So while you\u2019re he",
