        "subject": "Could You Start a Cult? \ud83e\udd14",
        "details": "(Not that you\u2019d want to\u2026)\r\n\r\nBut imagine if you became a \u2018celebrity\u2019 in your niche through viral video.\r\n\r\nOnce you are a \u2018celebrity\u2019, people trust you.\r\n\r\nThey feel they \r\n\r\n**know**you. And in a way, they actually do.\r\n\r\nIf they\u2019ve been reading your emails daily\u2026\r\n\r\nIf they\u2019ve been watching your videos religiously\u2026\r\n\r\nIf they\u2019ve read your book, listened to your podcast, and binged your content for years\u2026\r\n\r\nAt that point, they trust you more than anyone outside of their inner circle.\r\n\r\n(Or maybe even more than their inner circle, especially if the last two restaurant recommendations weren\u2019t too flash)\r\n\r\nSo when it comes time to buy, who are they going to listen to?\r\n\r\nYou, who\u2019ve they\u2019ve been watching go viral for months now?\r\n\r\nOr some rando sliding into their DMs with a cold pitch?\r\n\r\nBuilding an audience isn\u2019t just about visibility\u2014it\u2019s about trust. And once you have trust, selling gets a whole lot easier.\r\n\r\nNo long-winded pitches.\r\n\r\nNo exhausting follow-ups.\r\n\r\nNo endless \u201cproof\u201d needed.\r\n\r\nJust\u2026 \r\n\r\n**\u201cHey\u2014this is pretty cool. You\u2019d probably love it.\u201d**\r\n\r\nAnd your audience responds with a \r\n\r\n**Yes** or \r\n\r\n**No**.\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s the power of influence.\r\n\r\nAnd that\u2019s why we love viral videos.\r\n\r\nCreating short viral clips is one of the easiest ways to build an audience right now.\r\n\r\nInterested in unlocking this skill to go viral whenever you want? Reply \u201cviral\u201d and I\u2019ll send you the info.\r\n\r\nColin\r\n\r\n&#128640; \r\n\r\n**Want to Go Viral?**\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\r\nThe videos we\u2019ve created have racked up \r\n\r\n**over 348 years** of total watch time\u2014learn from our viral editor video here. https://mentorsofmentors.com/step/store-checkout-01-2-2/\r\n\r\n&#127916; \r\n\r\n**Your First Viral Video?**\r\n\r\nJoin our group coaching and unlock done-with-you step-by-step guidance to create content that explodes. Reply for more info.\r\n\r\n\u26a1 \r\n\r\n**Skip the Guesswork\u2014DFY Service**\r\n\r\nOur team scripts, edits, and optimizes videos, so you can focus on growing, not guessing. Reply and we can book a time to talk.\r\n\r\n&#128172; \r\n\r\n**Got a Question About Going Viral?**\r\n\r\nHit reply! I\u2019ll answer them in future emails.\r\n\r\n&#128200; \r\n\r\n**Watch Me Go From 0 to 100K Followers**\r\n\r\nSee me grow an Instagram account from scratch. Watch in real time.\r\n&#128073; Follow Colin https://www.instagram.com/colin.dingelstad/reels/\r\n\r\n****\r\n\r\nStill Reading? You Might Just Be My FavoriteLook at you, scrolling down like a detective on a mission. Whether you\u2019re incredibly thorough, a little nosy, or just really good at procrastinating, I appreciate your curiosity.So while you\u2019re here, let\u2019s be transparent about why you got this email, what we do with your info, and how you can control what lands in your inbox. Why You\u2019re Receiving This Email You\u2019re here because you probably saw one of our (or a partner\u2019s) videos going viral on Instagram. At some point\u2014whether in a moment of inspiration or curiosity\u2014you opted in to get insights, strategies, or just some behind-the-scenes magic on how to make Instagram work, instead o",
