        "summary": "Creating \u201caha\u201d moments can help you sell like crazy",
        "subject": "Creating \u201caha\u201d moments can help you sell like crazy",
        "details": "Every once in a while, you hear something that completely shifts your perspective.\r\n\r\nAn \r\n\r\n**\u2018aha\u2019** moment.\u00a0\r\n\r\nAn insight that connects the dots on experiences you\u2019ve had for years.\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s exactly what happened when a viral clip explained why some people experience anxiety for no apparent reason.\r\n\r\nImagine being told there\u2019s nothing wrong with you day after day, month after month, year after year\u2014and then one short video makes sense of it all.\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s what happened when people learned about the MTHFR gene mutation\u2014a condition that makes it hard to process folate properly.\r\n\r\nMind. Blown.\r\n\r\nBefore this video\u2026 nobody could explain their symptoms because there were no obvious triggers.\r\n\r\nThen BAM, Suddenly, it all made sense.\r\n\r\nThat video became the key to a door they didn\u2019t know existed.\r\n\r\nThe person sharing their wisdom became the instant authority that people trust and would happily buy from.\r\n\r\nNot by selling harder. Not by forcing people to believe them.\r\n\r\nBut by giving them a new insight that makes sense of their life experiences.\r\n\r\nAnd that\u2019s exactly how you can create instant credibility and persuasion in your business too.\r\n\r\nIf you can make someone say, \u201cOh my... that explains everything!\u201d\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ve already won them over.\r\n\r\nAnd when you pair that insight with a high-quality video?\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s game over.\r\n\r\nSuddenly, you\u2019re the authority. The trusted expert. The person who finally put the missing puzzle piece in place.\r\n\r\nWant to create your own viral \u2018aha\u2019 video?\u00a0\r\n\r\nI bet you\u2019ve got your own ideas for \u2018aha\u2019 content that people would love.\r\n\r\nColin\r\n\r\nMentors of Mentors, Meestersweg 6, 6071BN Swalmen, , The Netherlands\r\n\r\nUnsubscribe http://mentorsofmentors.activehosted.com/proc.php?nl=6&c=165&m=221&s=55f4bee756905bca3072c420f5c40527&act=unsub\r\n\r\nhttps://mentorsofmentors.store/2-step-system-new-years-discount",
