        "summary": "Coordination With Owner.com & Review of Our Marketing Scope",
        "subject": "Coordination With Owner.com & Review of Our Marketing Scope",
        "details": "Hi Jahan,\r\n\r\n\r\nHope you\u2019re doing well. I wanted to share a quick update \u2014 I recently\r\nsigned up with Owner.com to take over a portion of our marketing, online\r\nordering, and customer retention efforts. Since this affects some of the\r\nwork you\u2019re doing, I want to make sure we stay aligned and collaborative\r\nmoving forward.\r\n\r\n\r\nBelow is a breakdown of what Owner.com will be handling versus what I still\r\nneed from you so we can avoid overlap and keep everything running smoothly.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat Owner.com Will Handle\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n   - Online ordering platform and mobile ordering\r\n   - Website and landing page optimization\r\n   - Customer database & automated outreach (email/SMS)\r\n   - Loyalty and win-back campaigns\r\n   - Automated marketing flows and seasonal templates\r\n   - Review monitoring & Google review generation\r\n   - Analytics and reporting on customer behavior & ROI\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat I Still Need From You\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n   - Social media content creation (FB/IG posts, stories, reels)\r\n   - Brand creative: graphics, flyers, promotions\r\n   - Updated photography & short-form video\r\n   - Facebook/Instagram ad management (if we continue with ads)\r\n   - In-house marketing materials (menus, signage, table tents)\r\n   - Support for special events and community engagement\r\n   - Monthly or biweekly strategy collaboration so everything aligns with\r\n   Owner.com\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNext Steps\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\u2019d like us to set up a meeting to walk through this together, make sure\r\nroles are clear, and determine whether we should adjust or renegotiate our\r\ncurrent contract to reflect the new structure.\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know your availability for a quick meeting this week or early next\r\nweek.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\n-- \r\n*Kendell Sheppard*\r\n\r\n*KJ Sheppard Enterprise, LLC*\r\n\r\nCell 502-299-3778",
