        "details": "Aaron here from Cole\u2019s team.\r\n\r\nOur head of recruiting just told me we\u2019re ready to let loose a new batch of hungry setters looking to fill some sales calendars asap.\r\n\r\nSo if you want more quality leads right now\u2026\r\n\r\nJust wanted to make sure you\u2019ve seen Cole\u2019s note about this earlier (I\u2019ll copy the email below just in case):\r\n\r\n====\r\n\r\n====\r\n\r\nWant an appointment setter to completely take over filling your calendar with quality calls?\r\n\r\nIn case you\u2019re not aware\u2026\r\n\r\nAn A-player appointment setter is one of the few (if not only) low-risk hires you can make who can significantly shoot up your appointment volume.\r\n\r\nNot only do they work mostly on commissions\u2026\r\n\r\nBut they\u2019re also hungry and motivated to prove themselves and start booking calls for you asap.\r\n\r\nThis means:\r\n\r\n+ HOURS of white space back on your calendar (they\u2019re doing all the messenger \u201cback n\u2019 forth\u201d, follow-up, emailing, texting, and calling etc.)\r\n\r\n+ More QUALITY sales calls (setters only open your calendar to top-shelf prospects who don\u2019t suck up all your life energy and creative bandwidth.)\r\n\r\n+ No more leads sitting there wasting away uncontacted (most businesses lose out on so much opportunity by being TOO LATE to the game. A good setter will connect with all your leads within minutes of them showing interest to establish an early touchpoint and book more calls).\r\n\r\nAnd if you\u2019ve got a validated offer (not for beginners)...\r\n\r\nOur setters will book you at least 40+ quality appointments in the next 30 days\u2014or you do not pay.\r\n\r\nSound interesting?\r\n\r\nClick here now and book a demo with our team. (https://d2n5vF04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/OR+113/d2n5vF04/VXdvXc65N8YSW2-Wt-P5SLLRlW2bnPc75r8l3SN4Rsyfd5n4LbW5BWr2F6lZ3pyW8bDS1R2HBmF6W5P7qds4Tc5lJW6RLRLw6h55pjVL-zjF4Pkqw-W7GTrcH3wdbdWW104ZLg5yd6XnW9kYhlW2q33PKN3GjNk7ZsSgLW3kV62l2nznlwW6grJgR5SG69JW3JWF-h8Y594MW9cDH348cCKm4W6QCvkN5stKDpW6g_pJV9dY3LpW44f8vM8_Y5QpW1TmnK_68HS32W8QYZhl5bND0-W8jhG-970pZMsVhr5W563Y4wDW7CRG_18f2Zv2W8wgQPz8QsMH2W7J9Y043_7BhSW3GwYDl6zjvp7W91gLjh19Jmy6W42dY4Y3pHC4-W8grdZ-1bnV0RW36qWPs4yblg1W6FtvjF5pNhgmN3DNZlhf3t_6W1v6StC3P-rQ_W2WLgf_4k6QyvW8rgZ6D528gC1W3Dn8hv2DfbSMV8H58J4gG3_Bf7r2CsW04 )\r\n\r\n- CG\r\n\r\nClosers.io\r\n\r\n16211 N. Scottsdale RD. Ste A6A #460\r\n\r\nScottsdale  , AZ  , 85254\r\n\r\nUnited States\r\n\r\nUnsubscribe from our newsletter (https://hs-20171410.s.hubspotemail.net/hs/preferences-center/en/direct?data=W2nXS-N30h-zBW4t7L_M1_7H9FW4rH9_W2-J1GlW2CL0Jl3jvr3JW3Y2tFt4m9CLrW217szD3HdjpBW2FTLTc3XJqQLW47T-Hb3BJDJXW4tt8HF3T5S1LW3dyQ4l2y2Bc-W2Ws-Jv2MXVhqW1_5dGn4twcSfW3F8JTR3R3B0LW2-L7mf43nlCjW2Px1PN4rhqjzW1_kcdy3C14nYW3dvrQp1BMJJDW2YHktd1NfXD-W2xPr4W2B13p3W2Rxh6g3C8ZYkW23nCg81YZty9W3gcJTB45CDH2W2FM7DC2-cbWwW2YmNvF1V8Kp0W3z4FkN2Pkc57W1BPny_3g9cbVW2MDG184fH035W3bvD0C2p5n9tW21s69s3SB6rTW32HCyL43nQVnW3DYHz32qRH4tW250QzN2FS-KcW1_r1-5364WSnW2YcpWw2CMHq3W38l1j-2YnysdW1Bd3Hg38cTYcW2Mj_8j2WPm6cW3Vxscp4mdt7QW4mmBMR4rytZmW2nZ8j42-ByhkW2vz-8s3GV9_gW2Tt6CY3VPxzHW2THrhj34vpF6W2KpRQB4rxJzrW4kD6np45SZ79W2sT9FG2HsW60f2zXcw704&_hsenc=p2A",
