        "summary": "What top restaurants do differently...",
        "subject": "What top restaurants do differently...",
        "details": "Oracle\r\n\r\nHi Jahan,\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ve helped over 20,000 restaurants improve their operations. Now, we want to share what we've learned with you.\r\n\r\nAbove all, a strong online presence is at the core of any restaurant's success.\r\n\r\n* Have a responsive, Sales-Optimized Website that highlights their services and menu.\r\n* Add their website to their Google Business listing, social media, and review websites.\r\n* Constantly monitor connectivity health to ensure they don't miss any orders.\r\n* Personalize their service and reward loyalty with discounts and promotions.\r\n\r\nYou can find a full list of tips\u00a0here ( https://info.restaurantlogin.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=12a.+call+-+What+top+restaurants+do+differently&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#/en_US/system-overview/restaurant-key-success-factors ).\r\n\r\nHungry for more tailored advice from our Customer Success specialists?\r\n\r\nChat about even more restaurant success factors ( https://scheduler.oracle.com/pls/apex/r/ast_ext/meet/home?book=Vj6ZKVIlySFaQ4yV1e&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=12a.+call+-+What+top+restaurants+do+differently&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nSilviana Prioteasa\r\nDirector, Customer Success\r\nOracle Restaurants\r\n\r\nP.S. If you need help, you can always reply to this email or reach out to our Support team using the blue chat box in your dashboard.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/privacy.html?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=12a.+call+-+What+top+restaurants+do+differently&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) | Contact Us ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=12a.+call+-+What+top+restaurants+do+differently&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#contact ) | Unsubscribe ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSQzgELAKSWM6OWMwGa7c0m2RX6KANBxz0aw-A= )\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to hello@derbydigital.us ( hello@derbydigital.us?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=12a.+call+-+What+top+restaurants+do+differently&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )[Account ID 1814982], because the restaurant is using this Oracle online ordering system.\r\n\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2025 Oracle America, Inc., Austin - 2300 Oracle Way, Waterfront | Oracle HQ, AUSTIN23, 2300 Oracle Way, Austin, TX, 78741, United States\r\n\r\nOracle ( https://www.oracle.com/corporate/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=12a.+call+-+What+top+restaurants+do+differently&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )",
