        "subject": "How to pitch this POS to your restaurants | Oracle Restaurants eStore platform",
        "details": "Oracle\r\n\r\nHi Jahan,\r\n\r\nHelp your restaurants manage their business faster and more efficiently with our plug-and-play POS.\r\n\r\nWant to persuade them to purchase? Follow this cheatsheet to close the deal.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n* Monthly subscription: $49/month per location (2-year commitment; cannot be cancelled during this period).\r\n\r\n*\r\nFREE premium hardware starter kit\u00a0including POS workstation, countertop payment device, guest receipt printer, cash drawer and 5 employee RFID cards.\r\n\r\n*\r\nPOS advantage: use Oracle Payments for both in-store and online orders, eliminating the separate Online Payments monthly fee.\r\n\r\n*\r\nOne easy-to-use dashboard: Manage online orders, menus, staff & payments.\r\n\r\n*\r\nPayment variety: Accept a variety of payment methods, from cards to digital wallets.\r\n\r\n*\r\nIncreased operational efficiency: Improve communication between the kitchen and the dining area.\r\n\r\n*\r\nUnbeatable Offline Mode: Create checks and take in-store payments even when the internet is down.\r\n\r\n*\r\nIntuitive data analytics: Leverage online and on-premise insights from every sale.\r\n\r\n* Tell your Customer Success Manager which restaurants are ready to buy.\r\n\r\nStart selling this POS to your restaurants ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/api/aln/UTxE6UkMr5qTJjJBtJvMzyOTjF0cWiNRNp0m5ETdBG18lrkzFrobxwkPgdcXy71yGQwJfaNezZdXjdsy8avPZX93S8Nk?1&r=app.pnet.restaurants.index&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=9a.+US+only+-+How+to+pitch+this+POS+%26+win+over+any+restaurant&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nSilviana Prioteasa\r\nDirector, Customer Success\r\nOracle Restaurants\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/privacy.html?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=9a.+US+only+-+How+to+pitch+this+POS+%26+win+over+any+restaurant&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) | Contact Us ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=9a.+US+only+-+How+to+pitch+this+POS+%26+win+over+any+restaurant&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#contact ) | Unsubscribe ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSQzgELAKSWM6OWMwGav2XMnrSd58XN7HtSXfc= )\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to hello@derbydigital.us ( hello@derbydigital.us?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=9a.+US+only+-+How+to+pitch+this+POS+%26+win+over+any+restaurant&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )[Account ID 1814982], because the restaurant is using this Oracle online ordering system.\r\n\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2025 Oracle America, Inc., Austin - 2300 Oracle Way, Waterfront | Oracle HQ, AUSTIN23, 2300 Oracle Way, Austin, TX, 78741, United States\r\n\r\nOracle ( https://www.oracle.com/corporate/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+life",
