        "type": "email",
        "date": "2025-11-23",
        "summary": "Help restaurants fill more tables & reduce no-shows | Oracle Restaurants eStore platform",
        "subject": "Help restaurants fill more tables & reduce no-shows | Oracle Restaurants eStore platform",
        "details": "Oracle\r\n\r\nHi Jahan,\r\n\r\nHelp your restaurants serve more customers & decrease last-minute cancellations in 3 simple steps:\r\n*\r\n\u2713\u00a0Enable Table Reservations (& Food Pre-Orders);\r\n*\r\n\u2713\u00a0Publish the Table Reservation widget;\r\n*\r\n\u2713\u00a0NEW:\u00a0Activate Reservation Deposits.\r\nRestaurants can protect their revenue\u00a0by encouraging their guests to commit with a reservation deposit*.\r\n\r\n*To enable this feature, restaurants need to have the Table Reservation widget published and Online Payments activated.\r\n\r\n* Secure revenue even when they have no-shows.\r\n* Create their own refund policy (full, partial, or no refund).\r\n* Charge refunds per guest or per reservation.\r\n* Manage reservations, deposits & refunds directly from the order-taking app.\r\n* Enable their customers to opt-in for an SMS notification reminder.\r\n* See how it works ( https://info.restaurantlogin.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=8b.+call+-+Help+restaurants+fill+more+tables+%26+reduce+no-shows&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#/services-and-opening-hours/reservation-deposits-secure-revenue-and-reduce-empty-tables ).\r\n\r\nWant to chat more about how restaurants can enable this feature? Schedule a call with our Customer Success specialists.\r\n\r\nLet's chat about Reservation Deposits ( https://scheduler.oracle.com/pls/apex/r/ast_ext/meet/home?book=Vj6ZKVIlySFaQ4yV1e&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=8b.+call+-+Help+restaurants+fill+more+tables+%26+reduce+no-shows&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nSilviana Prioteasa\r\nDirector, Customer Success\r\nOracle Restaurants\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/privacy.html?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=8b.+call+-+Help+restaurants+fill+more+tables+%26+reduce+no-shows&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) | Contact Us ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=8b.+call+-+Help+restaurants+fill+more+tables+%26+reduce+no-shows&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#contact ) | Unsubscribe ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSQzgELAKSWM6OWMwGar-3_gRqM5o-pcpYUXxg= )\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to hello@derbydigital.us ( hello@derbydigital.us?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=8b.+call+-+Help+restaurants+fill+more+tables+%26+reduce+no-shows&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )[Account ID 1814982], because the restaurant is using this Oracle online ordering system.\r\n\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2025 Oracle America, Inc., Austin - 2300 Oracle Way, Waterfront | Oracle HQ, AUSTIN23, 2300 Oracle Way, Austin, TX, 78741, United States\r\n\r\nOracle ( https://www.oracle.com/corp",
