        "type": "email",
        "date": "2025-11-02",
        "summary": "How you can earn as an Oracle Restaurants eStore platform partner",
        "subject": "How you can earn as an Oracle Restaurants eStore platform partner",
        "details": "Oracle\r\n\r\nHi Jahan,\r\n\r\nThis kicks off a series of emails designed to help you start selling. We will provide tips & tricks on what you can do for your restaurants, so stay tuned.\r\n\r\nAs an Oracle Restaurants eStore platform partner, you now have full control to:\r\n* Create accounts;\r\n* Decide what services to display to restaurants;\r\n* Sell them our free & premium subscriptions with your own value-added services.\r\n\r\nAs a partner, you\u2019ll earn recurring revenue through:\r\n* Discounts/commissions on monthly paid subscriptions\r\n* And your own value-added services that you can charge for from day 1\r\n\r\nOnce you reach 5 paying clients, you unlock a 20% discount/commission\u00a0on our premium features. The discount increases as your business and the number of paying customers grow.\r\n\r\nWe encourage you to explore the Affiliate and Resell partner models to discover what works best for you.\r\n\r\nInterested in expert tips on how to grow faster from our Customer Success specialists?\r\n\r\nBook a one-on-one call ( https://scheduler.oracle.com/pls/apex/r/ast_ext/meet/home?book=Vj6ZKVIlySFaQ4yV1e&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=1b.+call+-+%28US+%26+UK+only%29+How+you+can+earn+as+a+GloriaFood+partner&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nSilviana Prioteasa\r\nDirector, Customer Success\r\nOracle Restaurants\r\n\r\nP.S. If you need help, you can always reply to this email or reach out to our Support team using the blue chat box in your dashboard.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/privacy.html?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=1b.+call+-+%28US+%26+UK+only%29+How+you+can+earn+as+a+GloriaFood+partner&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) | Contact Us ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=1b.+call+-+%28US+%26+UK+only%29+How+you+can+earn+as+a+GloriaFood+partner&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#contact ) | Unsubscribe ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSQzgELAKSWM6OWMwGaQ6eRBzV1CtBazlBvxbs= )\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to hello@derbydigital.us ( hello@derbydigital.us?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=1b.+call+-+%28US+%26+UK+only%29+How+you+can+earn+as+a+GloriaFood+partner&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )[Account ID 1814982], because the restaurant is using this Oracle online ordering system.\r\n\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2025 Oracle America, Inc., Austin - 2300 Oracle Way, Waterfront | Oracle HQ, AUSTIN23, 2300 Oracle Way, Austin, TX, 78741, United States\r\n\r\nOracle ( https://www.oracle.com/corporate/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+campaign+3+-+email+lifecycle+for+partners+with+their+1st+real+restaurant&utm_content=1b.+call+-+%28US+%26+UK+only%29+How+you",
