        "id": "email-135-12",
        "type": "email",
        "date": "2025-10-30",
        "summary": "New: Introducing Table Reservation Smart Links | Oracle Restaurants eStore",
        "subject": "New: Introducing Table Reservation Smart Links | Oracle Restaurants eStore",
        "details": "Oracle\r\n\r\nHi Jahan,\r\n\r\nWe're introducing Table Reservation Smart Links - a powerful new addition to the existing Smart Menu Order Link.\r\n\r\nWith this new tool, restaurants can boost table reservations via social media.\r\n\r\nIn just a few clicks, restaurant guests can book a table straight from the restaurant social profiles, just as easily as placing online orders.\r\n\r\n( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/api/aln/UTx1XU0zOn6HXpXNCRNGlJDiRC9cZF708WVrGjCPQnkj4V9NT6nnnE5mp0hWGnMaQagJHw4ZM0NPvYfvzVaYpNgEtzeQ?1&r=app.admin.setup.publishing.facebook_hot_link&utm_campaign=Partners+%3E+Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_content=Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\n\u2713 Helps convert social followers into confirmed reservations.\u2713 Simplifies guest experience, by enabling social media followers to place bookings faster.\u2713 Can be used across social media channels to maximize the restaurant's online exposure.\r\n\r\nRestaurants will enjoy a quick setup: * Copy the unique table reservation link from their restaurant Admin dashboard.\r\n*\r\nPaste it to\u00a0their Google profile, Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, Yelp, TripAdvisor, etc.\r\n*\r\nShare it in posts, stories or \"About\" sections to ensure it is seen by their potential guests, when their interest is highest.\r\n\r\nCheck it out ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/api/aln/UTx1XU0zOn6HXpXNCRNGlJDiRC9cZF708WVrGjCPQnkj4V9NT6nnnE5mp0hWGnMaQagJHw4ZM0NPvYfvzVaYpNgEtzeQ?1&r=app.admin.setup.publishing.facebook_hot_link&utm_campaign=Partners+%3E+Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_content=Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nSilviana Prioteasa\r\nDirector, Customer Service\r\nOracle Restaurants\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/privacy.html?utm_campaign=Partners+%3E+Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_content=Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) | Contact Us ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/?utm_campaign=Partners+%3E+Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_content=Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#contact ) | Unsubscribe ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSQzgEDAKSWM6OWMwGaNfO1_4MgizJkNe8Qvis= )\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to hello@derbydigital.us ( hello@derbydigital.us?utm_campaign=Partners+%3E+Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_content=Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )[Account ID 1814982], because the restaurant is using this Oracle online ordering system.\r\n\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2025 Oracle America, Inc., Austin - 2300 Oracle Way, Waterfront | Oracle HQ, AUSTIN23, 2300 Oracle Way, Austin, TX, 78741, United States\r\n\r\nOracle ( https://www.oracle.com/corporate/?utm_campaign=Partners+%3E+Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_content=Table+Reservation+Smart+Link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )",
