        "id": "email-135-13",
        "type": "email",
        "date": "2025-10-03",
        "summary": "Are you struggling? We're here to help",
        "subject": "Are you struggling? We're here to help",
        "details": "Oracle\r\n\r\nHi Jahan,\r\nYou\u2019ve been an Oracle Restaurants eStore partner for a month and you've yet to onboard your first client to this online ordering system.\r\n\r\nAre you struggling to sell this service? Check out our sales & marketing materials for useful tips & tricks.\r\n\r\nGet Help Here ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/api/aln/UTx1XU0zOn6HXpXNCRNGlJDiRC9cZF708WVrGjCPQnkj4V9NT6nnnE5mp0hWGnMaQagJHw4ZM0NPvYfvzVaYpNgEtzeQ?1&r=app.pnet.sales.way_to_go&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Are+you+struggling%3F+We%27re+here+to+help&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\nHere are additional resources for when you're ready to set up your first real restaurant account: * Learn the basic restaurant account settings from this setup video ( https://youtu.be/cZ1gwhmskgw?si=4v-0HLtb8DfJuPUR&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Are+you+struggling%3F+We%27re+here+to+help&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ).\r\n* Make sure they publish their menu ( https://youtu.be/1Mx7ecYopq0?si=oB8f1nrjw4G4BpQU&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Are+you+struggling%3F+We%27re+here+to+help&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) on their website or offer them the sales optimized website ( https://youtu.be/JAETqq5DQOo?si=Idr-i1rdg-SP0pDZ&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Are+you+struggling%3F+We%27re+here+to+help&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) service.\r\n* Help them start promoting ( https://info.restaurantlogin.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Are+you+struggling%3F+We%27re+here+to+help&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#/system-overview/restaurant-key-success-factors ) their restaurant business online.\r\nDo you need one-on-one help? We've got you covered!\r\n\r\nSchedule a call with a Customer\r\nSuccess specialist who can tell you more about the partner program, possible business models & answer all your questions.\r\n\r\nSchedule a Chat About Your Business Needs ( https://scheduler.oracle.com/pls/apex/r/ast_ext/meet/home?book=Vj6ZKVIlySFaQ4yV1e&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Are+you+struggling%3F+We%27re+here+to+help&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nSilviana PrioteasaDirector, Customer SuccessOracle Restaurants\r\n\r\nP.S. If you need help, you can always reply to this email or reach out to our Support using the blue chat box in your dashboard.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/privacy.html?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Are+you+struggling%3F+We%27re+here+to+help&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) | Contact Us ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Are+you",
