        "summary": "Welcome to the Oracle Restaurants eStore partner dashboard!",
        "subject": "Welcome to the Oracle Restaurants eStore partner dashboard!",
        "details": "Oracle\r\n\r\nHi Jahan,\r\nWelcome to the Oracle Restaurants eStore online ordering partner dashboard!\r\nYou can add restaurants, manage them, and sell premium services\u00a0from one\u00a0dashboard.\r\n\r\n* Go to Restaurants > Management to create your first real restaurant account.\r\n* Check Sales & Marketing to learn how to improve your website & attract restaurants interested in online ordering.\r\n* From Branding, you can\r\npromote your business to new restaurants by adding your own logo, contact info & messaging.\r\n* Discover how you can grow your business in the dedicated Knowledge base section.\r\n* Chat within minutes with our Support\u00a0team when you need help.\r\nWould you like to learn more about the partner program, possible business models & get your questions answered?\r\nSchedule a one-on-one call with our Customer Success specialists right now.\r\n\r\nLet's Chat About Your Business ( https://scheduler.oracle.com/pls/apex/r/ast_ext/meet/home?book=Vj6ZKVIlySFaQ4yV1e&utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Welcome+to+the+Oracle+Restaurants+eStore+partner+dashboard%21&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )\r\nRegards,\r\nSilviana PrioteasaDirector, Customer SuccessOracle Restaurants\r\n\r\nP.S. If you need any help, you can always reply to this email.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/privacy.html?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Welcome+to+the+Oracle+Restaurants+eStore+partner+dashboard%21&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle ) | Contact Us ( https://www.globalfoodsoft.com/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Welcome+to+the+Oracle+Restaurants+eStore+partner+dashboard%21&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle#contact ) | Unsubscribe ( http://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgSQzgEAAKSWM6OWMwGZBo9q5je5uCWtL-XaN7E= )\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to hello@derbydigital.us ( hello@derbydigital.us?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Welcome+to+the+Oracle+Restaurants+eStore+partner+dashboard%21&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )[Account ID 1814982], because the restaurant is using this Oracle online ordering system.\r\n\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2025 Oracle America, Inc., Austin - 2300 Oracle Way, Waterfront | Oracle HQ, AUSTIN23, 2300 Oracle Way, Austin, TX, 78741, United States\r\n\r\nOracle ( https://www.oracle.com/corporate/?utm_campaign=IMPROVED+-+%5Bpartners%5D+%5Bcampaign+2%5D+for+accepted+partners&utm_content=Welcome+to+the+Oracle+Restaurants+eStore+partner+dashboard%21&utm_medium=email&utm_source=lifecycle )",
