        "summary": "PHPmail sending suspended for your Business Web Hosting",
        "subject": "PHPmail sending suspended for your Business Web Hosting",
        "details": "Here\u2019s how to restore it     Hostinger (\nhostinger.com )\n\nLog in  \n( https://clicks.hostinger.com/f/a/t0y4aqCpYlKkXaI4qwRncQ~~/AAAHahA~/sigJiy7WkXdh3-9Pg5kDC1yFRdEoBq3-9VTuXihYSeByl8qgin1Su-Gd0jILs7YWJi5GuOvtOUX0fM3XQe6WTl6JyIqHcmT6VOiU0XoNRYr0x-WTfpeJ0BPFphhEC82j )\nLog in  \n( https://clicks.hostinger.com/f/a/t0y4aqCpYlKkXaI4qwRncQ~~/AAAHahA~/sigJiy7WkXdh3-9Pg5kDC1yFRdEoBq3-9VTuXihYSeByl8qgin1Su-Gd0jILs7YWJi5GuOvtOUX0fM3XQe6WTl6JyIqHcmT6VOiU0XoNRYr0x-WTfpeJ0BPFphhEC82j )\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHey there,\n\n<b>We've temporarily suspended email sending for your Business Web Hosting plan (palmaitalian.com), because you\u2019ve reached the daily sending limit.</b>\n\nYour hosting plan uses PHP\u2019s sendmail() function, which isn\u2019t suitable for sending larger volumes of emails.\n\nHow to restore sending\n----------------------------------\n\nUpdate your email-sending scripts to use SMTP authentication via a library such as PHPMailer. \n\n* <a href=\"https://clicks.hostinger.com/f/a/rUap-wBDyRoOUokqwMOC1w~~/AAAHahA~/w5GPCf3oFXfvYQec8cvVEbGkTRBR_u68PsWzxQ_Pt0Z1Uh9qk-EoJG0VJ7VH6F_O6k8GJXYPW9XWOvs1tAmQ_v1BjKp4GcYLZ6nF3hsZOHqHt9UITaE0FG_VQNujDay9aR-jZFYQeZWn4YnvP8jJnAg-LeFLz1ZVKSEKa5hHcUrESp-OSZlUtTv2ksTmCBTZAjtV7Wq-JbiXPWjR-D3dKw~~ style=\"color: #673de6;\">Step-by-step SMTP setup guide</a>\n* <a href=\"https://clicks.hostinger.com/f/a/HRYSUAC4D_30DyK6knOnSw~~/AAAHahA~/w2JPJRn21KZaJg_hoGmxpZbq6ycOkWyL3wZbzothXyNklGu8sTmYK1LX5pshjV48BRASSh0yKWeArrsoIMZjkFmsEPGpnLLTA9LkhTxwJW4atYmmL80Li_sj7h9N44ZOKMQ6sA6W_l26dGo-Q-QIVA~~ style=\"color: #673de6;\">Step-by-step SMTP setup guide for Wordpress</a>\n\nCheck your email logs\n----------------------------------\n\nYou can find detailed logs in /.logs/exim.log. These show:\n\n* Which email address was used to send\n* The current sending rate\n* The type of limit reached (daily or per minute)\n\nRate limits\n----------------------------------\n\n* Daily: 100 emails\n* Per minute: 10 emails\nSending will be re-enabled automatically once your rate goes back within these limits.\n\nIf you need help, reply to this email to contact our Customer Success team.\n\nThe Hostinger Team\n    Hostinger (\nhostinger.com )\nYou have received this email because you are registered at Hostinger, to ensure the implementation of our Terms of Service and (or) for other legitimate matters.\n\nLinkedIn \n( https://clicks.hostinger.com/f/a/5NVBIHkd6CIlOquAwdu3Vw~~/AAAHahA~/cjq5-ubbVdM0J50UDveSk7uVvyY1CvgZ5aaDhqXYkUz7MFJuAg0zimLEkfcCcL9qA4RwRe6zbHx3jKLmaCvdwRu0nB4iPoTaNsmwn2UovHz6wQEFeRbkkupQqgXinVZBJr5Jw-hqXGc1C60rRpFFRKATy7L5nnCsZsJiQzgyQdlIXAIZULqhYdIVElhPYE1M )\n Facebook ( https://clicks.hostinger.com/f/a/v1ZeYmMEJV2AW6hWyIBnhw~~/AAAHahA~/1t96NFKhRvjcUDgP585COn1FX_dP8bPH1Wx0ERSnGVAiSprnQk2_POnWxIuOE_-SECyYHqWTTzwJCeTvEMTA2bEK8Y0tklT1iz-elZg9yaNWeKOsHsjrftwZMNKnO-Qt91LPpOFMRyimo79zfagpxQ~~ )\nInstagram \n( https://clicks.hostinger.com/f/a/lsNOfn6w8ZEEw7Kw1CGGbg~~/AAAHahA~/1tVfLRdqw4H1UFkBndktRzxjvi_sAj9U9x2ZrXl0m_jkIIx2wLOgPOOCMXCP66GROZYPj0PLknQ4aJXzxyMWX_6kUjINXj19RtsMSOyPsTp0J1pClcgEKG7cApjxx8Uz8eJ3hx-3k",
