        "details": "Jahan,\r\n\r\nAs per the subject of my email, what I'm about to share with you is probably my best work to date & I do NOT say that lightly.\r\n\r\nOn Monday 16th March 2026 at 4PM UK time, I'm doing something I've genuinely never done before. I'm teaching our client acquisition framework PUBLICLY, for the FIRST time ever.\r\n\r\nThe actual way of thinking about client acquisition that underpins everything we've built and everything our best clients do when they're winning.\r\n\r\nAnd I want to be clear about what I mean by \"first time ever.\"\r\n\r\nI've taught pieces of this inside our programs for years. But I've NEVER sat down and laid out the whole thing, start to finish, in public, EVER.\r\n\r\nAnd transparently speaking, I don't know when I'll do it again.\r\n\r\nIt's free, it's live, and I'd genuinely be gutted if you missed it.\r\n\r\n**Register inside my free Skool group.**\r\nhttps://northflowconsulting.acemlna.com/lt.php?x=4lZy~GE4VXTODXWu-N-7Vxae2q7Ti_b2j-cykKQ4I3Cf6KB9_ky.0OFv2HBziNL0j_YxYIHIJFOiT8Dv0N1JU.BrPbKRia\r\n\r\nOver n out.\r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\nCharlie\r\n\r\nIf you are reading this message, it's because you are using an older device. So, we want to ensure that you know a few things, including: - Why you're receiving these emails - How we treat your privacy - How to manage your preferences - How to access important pages - Our commitment to you - A bit of legal Hello, and thank you for taking the time to read this email. This message is part of an ongoing conversation between us, and I want to take a moment to ensure you have full transparency about why you received this message, how your information is handled, and what to expect from future emails. Why You're Receiving This Email You're receiving this email because at some point, you opted in to receive updates, news, or information on a specific topic we've previously discussed or shared. Whether it was\r\nthrough a subscription, a form submission, or another form of communication, your information was shared willingly, and we respect your dec",
