        "subject": "I probably shouldn\u2019t send you this. But here goes.",
        "details": "Jahan, you know I \r\n\r\n**love** client acquisition right?\r\n\r\nI\u2019m known for it.\u00a0\r\n\r\nI talk about it everywhere.\r\n\r\nBut here\u2019s a true confession for you.\u00a0\r\n\r\nClient acquisition is often the \r\n\r\n**last** thing I have my consulting clients action.\u00a0\r\n\r\nCrazy, I know.\u00a0\r\n\r\nSee, to me, client acquisition is actually a result of various inputs that make it work and grow over time.\u00a0\r\n\r\nBy focusing JUST on client acquisition, you kind of miss the various trees in front of you\u2026\r\n\r\nBy overfixating and focusing on the forest.\u00a0\r\n\r\nWhen sadly, any one of those trees could measurably increase your business results, revenues, and profits.\u00a0\r\n\r\nThis means we fixate on:\r\n\r\n* Your offers\r\n\r\n* Your messaging\r\n\r\n* Your sales processes\r\n\r\n* Your retention and ecosystem\r\n\r\nEach of these needs reviewed and improved to produce the end result of a client acquisition system that brings in quality, retaining clients, at higher offer prices.\r\n\r\nFun thing is, we do this on free consulting calls so we can get to know you, and it also helps strategize with you. It\u2019s like the best of Imperium\u2122, just free and available.\u00a0\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ve got some calendar space right now, so book in using the button below:\r\n\r\nBook in here Jahan https://go.imperiumacquisition.com/imperium-systems?el=I%20probably%20shouldn%E2%80%99t%20send%20you%20this.%20But%20here%20goes.\r\n\r\nBest,\u00a0\r\n\r\n- Charlie\r\n\r\n**Making Client Acquisition Easy**\r\n\r\nCo-Founder, Imperium Acquisition\u2122\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nIf you are reading this message, it\u2019s because you are using an older device. So, we want to ensure that you know a few things, including: - Why you\u2019re receiving these emails - How we treat your privacy - How to manage your preferences - How to access important pages - Our commitment to you - A bit of legal Hello, and thank you for taking the time to read this email. This message is part of an ongoing conversation between us, and I want to take a moment to ensure you have full transparency about why you received this message, how your information is handled",
