        "subject": "Why *Most* CEOs and Founders \u201cCRACK\u201d",
        "details": "Here\u2019s why most founders crack, Jahan.\r\n\r\nA business is \u201cput on top\u201d of your life.\u00a0\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s a demanding, volatile object subject to MANY things outside your control. Market sophistication is one, rising ad costs is another, hype of markets (say AI) is another.\u00a0\r\n\r\nIF you have cracks anywhere in your life, the demands of the business weigh down \r\n\r\n**so heavily** on those cracks that it forces them open.\u00a0\r\n\r\nThe business is linked to your worth, your needs, your survival. And so naturally its weight causes heavier damage in comparison to other pressures.\u00a0\r\n\r\nIF the cracks were already present, already wide, or already deep\u2026 the weight of the business \r\n\r\n**can** cause things to completely unravel, if not fall apart.\u00a0\r\n\r\nThe \u201cbad\u201d habit. The food. The TV shows. The YT vids you (over)watch. The compulsions. The (potential) addictions.\r\n\r\nThese are coping mechanisms designed to originally keep the cracks together.\u00a0\r\n\r\nBut the business is like a 6-storey building placed upon cracked foundations\u2026 hoping it all holds together.\u00a0\r\n\r\nThe pressure simply exposes everything you were:\r\n\r\n* Ignoring\u00a0\r\n\r\n* Unwilling to face\r\n\r\n* Unconscious of\r\n\r\n* Or consciously avoided\r\n\r\nEntrepreneurship is one \r\n\r\n**massive** self-improvement journey that is a forcing function to betterment.\u00a0\r\n\r\nI\u2019ve found NO better way to improve holistically (myself, my businesses, my emotional management) than simply being around other entrepreneurs growing.\u00a0\r\n\r\nAnd today, there\u2019s 3 ways I can help you do that:\r\n\r\nThe first and fastest:\r\n\r\nWant to grow? Acquisition Nirvana\u2122 has our team consulting you to scale to your first 6-figure business in 6 - 12 months https://go.imperiumacquisition.com/imperium-systems?el=Why%20*Most*%20CEOs%20and%20Founders%20%E2%80%9CCRACK%E2%80%9D\r\n\r\nThe second, and longest running:\r\n\r\nOur mastermind aims to produce 7-figure founders (mostly in profit!) by applying our systems and trainings directly to your business - from our C-suite team, to yours. https://go.imperiumacquisition",
