        "date": "2026-03-04",
        "summary": "The New-Age Top 5 Dying Regrets to *Avoid*",
        "subject": "The New-Age Top 5 Dying Regrets to *Avoid*",
        "details": "Jahan, you\u2019ve probably heard of some of these.\u00a0\r\n\r\nBut a few years back, a palliative care nurse, someone who specialized in end-of-life care started making mental notes of the regrets dying people lamented on their beds.\u00a0\r\n\r\nPatterns emerged.\u00a0\r\n\r\n**Predictable** patterns.\u00a0\r\n\r\nYou likely know them.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u201cI wish I spent more time with family.\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cI wish I hadn\u2019t worked so hard.\u201d\r\n\r\nThose are just off the top of my head.\u00a0\r\n\r\nThe actual top 5 are as follows:\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a01. \"I wish I had the courage to live a life true to myself, not the life others\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0expected of me.\"\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a02. \"I wish I hadn't worked so hard.\"\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a03. \"I wish I'd had the courage to express my feelings.\"\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a04. \"I wish I had stayed in touch with my friends.\"\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a05. \"I wish that I had let myself be happier.\"\r\n\r\nHowever in the future, I believe this will be different.\u00a0\r\n\r\n**Predictably different**.\u00a0\r\n\r\nThe following are what I feel the top 5 regrets will change in the next few decades:\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a01. \u201cI wish I spent less time on a screen or in digital worlds\u201d\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a02. \u201cI wish I spent less time thinking what others think of me\u201d\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a03. \u201cI wish I spent more time in nature\u201d\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a04. \u201cI wish I took a risk and walked my own path, instead of the safe path\u201d\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a05. \u201cI wish I lived closer to family, friends, and community\u201d\r\n\r\nSo what will you do?\r\n\r\nChoose or wait?\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a01. It\u2019s better to try, than fail. Doing nothing is instant failure.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a02. Draw a line with success, income, or wealth. When hit, start to chill. A bit.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a03. Spend time with people who make you feel alive.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a04. Build the business (EasyGrow 2.0\u2122 shortcuts it https://app.iclosed.io/e/imperium/discovery-call-o)\r\n\r\n\u00a0\u00a05. Scale the business (Acquisition Nirvana\u2122 helps you get there https://app.iclosed.io/e/imperium/discovery-call-o)\r\n\r\nMy aims for those who work with me?\r\n\r\nThe mind of an entrepreneur. The drive of an athlete. The inquisitiveness of an artist.\u00a0\r\n\r\nCultivating all three with good self-awareness \r\n\r\n**should** be enough to live at t",
