        "summary": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "subject": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "details": "I'd really appreciate your brutally honest feedback since it helps me improve my business and build more free tools for agencies. What's holding you back from moving forward with our Google Business Profile optimization services for Derby Digital? Price, what's included, my face? I'm not going to bug you any more if you don't reply, I promise.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nThanks so much,\r\n\r\nJustin\r\n\r\nSignature header Signature image Justin\u00a0Silverman Founder & CEO Phone +1 (323)\r\n212-5327 Email justin@merchynt.com Signature image ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/1tgsohcq ) Www ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/b3kryt1v ) Linkedin-in ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/oiznuslr ) Youtube ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/v65cq9e6 ) Facebook-f ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/2wyq23hk ) Signature image\r\n\r\nYouTube ( https://www.youtube.com/@merchynt )LinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/gomerchynt/ )Facebook ( https://www.facebook.com/Merchynt )Instagram ( https://instagram.com/merchynt/?hl=en )Twitter ( https://twitter.com/merchynt )\u00a92026 Merchynt LLC\r\n3101 Ocean Park Blvd Ste 100 PMB 285 Santa Monica, CA 90405\r\n\r\nYou received this email after requesting pricing to Merchynt's reseller pricing. If you're no longer interested in receiving emails about the Merchynt agency program please unsubscribe here ( https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSlnAkAAIWKB4SKBwGcd8tqNY9ImDz84QusYBg= ).",
