        "summary": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "subject": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "details": "What type of business were you thinking about using our white-label Google Business Profile optimization service for? I can let you know if they'd be a good fit.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nAs for pricing, thanks to our industry leading and proprietary AI tools, we're able to provide more features and tasks each month as part of our service than any other company in the world, while passing along the savings to you. That means you and your clients get significantly more & better results, and you pay less.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nLet me know if you have any questions and I'll be happy to help.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\n\r\nJustin Silverman\r\n\r\nSignature header Signature image\r\nJustin\u00a0Silverman Founder & CEO Phone +1 (323) 212-5327 Email justin@merchynt.com Signature image ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/1tgsohcq ) Www ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/b3kryt1v ) Linkedin-in ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/oiznuslr ) Youtube ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/v65cq9e6 ) Facebook-f ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/2wyq23hk ) Signature image YouTube ( https://www.youtube.com/@merchynt )LinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/gomerchynt/ )Facebook ( https://www.facebook.com/Merchynt )Instagram ( https://instagram.com/merchynt/?hl=en )Twitter ( https://twitter.com/merchynt )\u00a92026 Merchynt LLC\r\n3101 Ocean Park Blvd Ste 100 PMB 285 Santa Monica, CA 90405\r\n\r\nYou received this email after requesting pricing to Merchynt's reseller pricing. If you're no longer interested in receiving emails about the Merchynt agency program please unsubscribe here ( https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSlnAkAAIWKB4SKBwGcTph-ezpsMGHE_uEF6vE= ).",
