        "date": "2026-02-08",
        "summary": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "subject": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "details": "Jahan@Derbydigital.Us,\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nDid you notice when reviewing our Agency Partner Program details that we're a bit different from other white label SEO services? If not, I can explain why Derby Digital would be in great hands with us:\r\n\r\n*\r\nWe're rated Excellent on Trustpilot (Really hard to do as a marketing agency!) This is what our customers actually think about us: https://reviews.merchynt.com/x0E1KCa\r\n* We give our partners white label tools to help them get more clients faster since we only grow when they do.\r\n*\r\nWe provide sales assistance when needed to close tough leads.\r\n* All we do is Google Business Profile optimization so we're able to stay up to date with the latest and greatest strategies. In fact, we're considered industry leaders and won the award for \"Top 10 Google Marketing Company\" by MarTech!\r\n\r\nIf you want to revisit this or sign up you can do so here: https://merchynt.com/agencies. Just want to white label Paige? No need to join our Partner Program. Just sign up for Paige at www.merchynt.com/paige\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\n\r\nJustin\r\n\r\nSignature header Signature image\r\nJustin\u00a0Silverman Founder & CEO Phone +1 (323) 212-5327 Email justin@merchynt.com Signature image ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/1tgsohcq ) Www ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/b3kryt1v ) Linkedin-in ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/oiznuslr ) Youtube ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/v65cq9e6 ) Facebook-f ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/2wyq23hk ) Signature image YouTube ( https://www.youtube.com/@merchynt )LinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/gomerchynt/ )\r\nFacebook ( https://www.facebook.com/Merchynt )Instagram ( https://instagram.com/merchynt/?hl=en )Twitter ( https://twitter.com/merchynt )\u00a92026 Merchynt LLC\r\n3101 Ocean Park Blvd Ste 100 PMB 285 Santa Monica, CA 90405\r\n\r\nYou received this email after requesting pricing to Merchynt's reseller pricing. If you're no longer interested in receiving emails about the Merchynt agency program please unsubscribe here ( https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSlnAkAAIWKB4SKBwGcPyVnKxWb88VNzLHldcE= ).",
