        "summary": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "subject": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "details": "Jahan@Derbydigital.Us,\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nDid you have any questions about our Agency Partner Program or GMB services for Derby Digital after requesting pricing yesterday? In case you clicked away from the details page by accident, you can find it again here ( https://www.merchynt.com/agency-program ). You can also see our customer success stories here ( https://hubs.ly/Q02dJ0nY0 ). We're rated Excellent on Trustpilot ( https://www.trustpilot.com/review/merchynt.com ) for a reason.\r\n\r\nFeel free to book a call with me or a teammate here ( https://meetings.hubspot.com/merchynt/sales-team-calendar ) if you'd like, or you can simply sign up here: https://merchynt.com/agencies.\r\n\r\nThank you for your interest in my company's services,\r\n\r\nJustin\r\n\r\nSignature header Signature image Justin\u00a0Silverman Founder & CEO Phone +1 (323) 212-5327 Email\r\njustin@merchynt.com Signature image ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/1tgsohcq ) Www ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/b3kryt1v ) Linkedin-in ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/oiznuslr ) Youtube ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/v65cq9e6 ) Facebook-f ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/2wyq23hk ) Signature image YouTube ( https://www.youtube.com/@merchynt )LinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/gomerchynt/ )\r\nFacebook ( https://www.facebook.com/Merchynt )Instagram ( https://instagram.com/merchynt/?hl=en )Twitter ( https://twitter.com/merchynt )\u00a92026\u00a0 Merchynt LLC\r\n3101 Ocean Park Blvd Ste 100 PMB 285 Santa Monica, CA 90405\r\n\r\nYou received this email after requesting pricing to Merchynt's reseller pricing. If you're no longer interested in receiving emails about the Merchynt agency program please unsubscribe here ( https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSlnAkAAIWKB4SKBwGcOf8DU-0gFAbdkgHtAXM= ).",
