        "date": "2026-02-06",
        "summary": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "subject": "You requested agency pricing?",
        "details": "Sorry for the fast follow up Jahan@Derbydigital.Us!\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nI just realized I didn't send you the one that that really matters - proof our service actually works! We've compiled a ton of customer success stories which you can see for yourself here ( https://merchynt.com/customer-success-stories ). These results aren't outliers - we get over 90% of our clients in the top 3 of Google Maps every single month. We asked all of our agency partners what they thought about us, and this is what they said ( https://reviews.merchynt.com/x0E1KCa ).\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nLet me know if you want to chat.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\n\r\nJustin\r\n\r\nSignature header Signature image\r\nJustin\u00a0Silverman Founder & CEO Phone +1 (323) 212-5327 Email justin@merchynt.com Signature image ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/1tgsohcq ) Www ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/b3kryt1v ) Linkedin-in ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/oiznuslr ) Youtube ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/v65cq9e6 ) Facebook-f ( https://scribe.merchynt.com/s2/2wyq23hk ) Signature image YouTube ( https://www.youtube.com/@merchynt )LinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/gomerchynt/ )\r\nFacebook ( https://www.facebook.com/Merchynt )Instagram ( https://instagram.com/merchynt/?hl=en )Twitter ( https://twitter.com/merchynt )\u00a92026 Merchynt LLC\r\n3101 Ocean Park Blvd Ste 100 PMB 285 Santa Monica, CA 90405\r\n\r\nYou received this email after requesting pricing to Merchynt's reseller pricing. If you're no longer interested in receiving emails about the Merchynt agency program please unsubscribe here ( https://track.customer.io/manage_subscription_preferences/dgSlnAkAAIWKB4SKBwGcNNib6BPEyCLimCWHUNw= ).",
