        "date": "2026-03-12",
        "summary": "STEAL THIS: Amazon\u2019s Secret to Employee Retention",
        "subject": "STEAL THIS: Amazon\u2019s Secret to Employee Retention",
        "details": "View image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f745d6c4-c5dd-4489-be60-3a035da5bceb/unnamed.png?t=1758498716)\r\nCaption: \r\n\r\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/7f327b56-501e-46b0-a2bd-47be92c93a07/image.png?t=1716956203)\r\nCaption: \r\n\r\n----------\r\n\ud83d\udca1** **_**Today's Key Insight:**_\r\n\r\nThe best companies don\u2019t guess how employees feel. They measure it daily and act on it immediately.\r\n\r\n\r\n----------View image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/7a91ee2a-7113-4e7d-af13-9e5b325aa787/unnamed.png?t=1758498967)\r\nCaption: \r\n\r\nBefore I dive into today\u2019s newsletter: \r\n\r\nIf you haven\u2019t yet taken my survey on [AI Readiness + Adoption](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1v_O8jLvCH0gUJO83hhDJWZZzoreibbbh4FTxEFQ1VK0/edit?ts=69afa9fe&_bhlid=05a9696189409f916ce0735d7d4f6d0f6f9c94b5), I\u2019d really appreciate it if you checked it out. It\u2019ll only take a minute to fill out, and I\u2019m adding an incentive. Once you complete it, you\u2019ll be entered for a chance to win a $250 Amazon gift card!\r\n\r\n[Take the survey here \u2192](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1v_O8jLvCH0gUJO83hhDJWZZzoreibbbh4FTxEFQ1VK0/edit?ts=69afa9fe&_bhlid=05a9696189409f916ce0735d7d4f6d0f6f9c94b5)\r\n\r\nView image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/7a91ee2a-7113-4e7d-af13-9e5b325aa787/unnamed.png?t=1758498967)\r\nCaption: \r\n\r\n## Amazon\u2019s Secret Weapon\u00a0\r\n\r\nAmazon has one of the most effective employee retention systems I\u2019ve ever seen.\r\n\r\nAnd oddly enough, I almost never hear it mentioned in business articles or management discussions. It might actually be one of Amazon\u2019s biggest secrets.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s called Amazon Connection Scores, and the idea is incredibly simple.\r\n\r\nEvery single Amazon employee\u2013whether they\u2019re working ",
