        "summary": "You\u2019re not just distracted",
        "subject": "You\u2019re not just distracted",
        "details": "\u200b\r\n\r\n\"Five minutes each week that might change your life.\"\r\n\r\n47 people had a breakthrough last week. Read this newsletter on\r\nMarkManson.net (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/38uge2kqz9ukh2m9g4gspu4pe7l43i7h5pl7w/vqh3hrholwz3xvcg/aHR0cHM6Ly9tYXJrbWFuc29uLm5ldC9icmVha3Rocm91Z2gvMTkyLWRpc3RyYWN0aW9ucz91dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bW1uZXQtbmV3c2xldHRlci0yMDI2MjAtMDMtMDkmdXRtX2NvbnRlbnQ9dmlldy1pbi1icm93c2VyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX3NvdXJjZT1tbW5ldC1uZXdzbGV0dGVy\r\n).\r\n\r\n---------------------------------\r\nTWO THINGS FOR YOU TO THINK ABOUT\r\n---------------------------------\r\n\r\nYour distractions aren\u2019t random.\r\n\r\nWhat you reach for when things get uncomfortable tells you what\r\nyou\u2019re trying not to feel.\r\n\r\nShare this:\r\n\r\n\u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/38uge2kqz9ukh2m9g4gspu4pe7l43i7h5pl7w/l2hehmhlex8v04s6/aHR0cHM6Ly94LmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvcmV0d2VldD90d2VldF9pZD0yMDMwMzI1MTUxNzkxNzE4NzY2\r\n) \u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/38uge2kqz9ukh2m9g4gspu4pe7l43i7h5pl7w/m2h7h5h3v4d0g0um/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaW5zdGFncmFtLmNvbS9wL0RWbHU0Y1hFNDE5Lw==\r\n) \u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/38uge2kqz9ukh2m9g4gspu4pe7l43i7h5pl7w/dpheh0hevplw4mim/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwcyUzQSUyRiUyRnd3dy5mYWNlYm9vay5jb20lMkZNYXJrbWFuc29ubmV0JTJGcG9zdHMlMkZwZmJpZDAyREdVN3luR1ZTRFFKSG1OUThUdG1ZN2ZjVVZCR3dMNEJjZEgydmpwSExzV3podXFySlZqcURTZkJGRkh4cnA1Tmw=\r\n) \u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.\r\n) \u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/38uge2kqz9ukh2m9g4gspu4pe7l43i7h5pl7w/7qh7h8h9qnrpk0tz/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhyZWFkcy5jb20vQG1hcmttYW5zb24vcG9zdC9EVmx5MlpEam4yUw==\r\n)\r\n\r\nAvoidance feels like relief in the moment, but w",
