        "summary": "Stop worrying about goals",
        "subject": "Stop worrying about goals",
        "details": "\u200b\r\n\r\n\"Five minutes each week that might change your life.\"\r\n\r\n91 people had a breakthrough last week. Read this newsletter on\r\nMarkManson.net (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/92ulq289r4anh607666izuzdlqz00awh256qm/vqh3hrhol0g5v9fg/aHR0cHM6Ly9tYXJrbWFuc29uLm5ldC9icmVha3Rocm91Z2gvMTkwLWdvYWxzP3V0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1tbW5ldC1uZXdzbGV0dGVyLTIwMjYxOC0wMy0wMiZ1dG1fY29udGVudD12aWV3LWluLWJyb3dzZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fc291cmNlPW1tbmV0LW5ld3NsZXR0ZXI=\r\n).\r\n\r\n--------------------------------\r\nONE THING FOR YOU TO THINK ABOUT\r\n--------------------------------\r\n\r\nGoals are the actions you think about but don\u2019t do.\r\nHabits are the actions you do but don\u2019t think about.\r\n\r\nBetter goals require a lot of effort and change little.\r\nBetter habits will change everything.\r\n\r\nShare this:\r\n\r\n\u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/92ulq289r4anh607666izuzdlqz00awh256qm/l2hehmhle2rgn8a6/aHR0cHM6Ly94LmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvcmV0d2VldD90d2VldF9pZD0yMDI3NzkxMTI1Nzg4OTcxNDg3\r\n) \u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/92ulq289r4anh607666izuzdlqz00awh256qm/dpheh0hev653o2cm/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaW5zdGFncmFtLmNvbS9wL0RWVHlxSE5rOHJmLw==\r\n) \u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/92ulq289r4anh607666izuzdlqz00awh256qm/7qh7h8h9qlzg6gcz/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwcyUzQSUyRiUyRnd3dy5mYWNlYm9vay5jb20lMkZNYXJrbWFuc29ubmV0JTJGcG9zdHMlMkZwZmJpZDBkOWdrYkhxMXV3eG5nNFF1b0huRVJneUZCcUp2UHNVQ3dtTUh0a0NNVFRWWkFqZ0tMRGdlRmNqOXNlbmVIb2dCbA==\r\n) \u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/92ulq289r4anh607666izuzdlqz00awh256qm/owhkhqhwp9ozn3hv/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cubGlua2VkaW4uY29tL3NoYXJlQXJ0aWNsZT9taW5pPXRydWUmdXJsPWh0dHBzJTNBJTJGJTJGd3d3LmxpbmtlZGluLmNvbSUyRnBvc3RzJTJGbWFya21hbnNvbl9nb2Fscy1hcmUtdGhlLWFjdGlvbnMteW91LXRoaW5rLWFib3V0LWJ1dC1hY3Rpdml0eS03NDMzNTU2ODE3MzM2NjQ3NjgwLXNDdG4=\r\n) \u200b (\r\nhttps://fc541894.click.convertkit-mail4.com/92ulq289r4anh607666izuzdlqz00awh256qm/z2hghnhen6wg74hp/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhyZWFkcy5jb20vQG1hcmttYW5zb24vcG9zdC9EVlR5Z2g4RHB1Rg==\r\n",
