        "subject": "\ud83d\udce6 Chaos packaging: love it or hate it?",
        "details": "Jahan, unbox the design trend breaking the mold\n\n\n\n \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \n\u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \n\u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c\n <https://app.envato.com/>\n <https://app.envato.com/>\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/learn/chaos-packaging-trend>\n\nChaos packaging trend: The rise of maximalism branding\n\n\nClean branding had its moment. Now maximalism is pushing back. Chaos packaging \nis all about contrast, collision, and visuals that demand attention.It\u2019s not \nclutter; it\u2019s impact.Let's explore the trend redefining shelves in 2026 \n<https://links.m.elements.envato.com/u/click?_t=e9a9cfe4aa0f4007a65c282ba1ff6eeb&_m=a4LNn6LEJseuZPQM6u8uEuzZq2P7twwoiE&_e=RPUXTCquFvnXOyNerZmkoRs5cpIsS2OebTztLGZcPWNxEhVLR9lSAAVv4SeWap5OOpBqW1EaJpZm0jn_FRka4_UhBEFDU6bodBb3bnixSxVaqtJ7HaC89Vg7qOlG9t9hz3GZx-DPE-Hk8pH1baIDBEo9xExKH_2h8qqvqoub5dK5NbnPC3eY6pTqu_NsxnQXrSDPA5fg74bwTq4fm4Q2vpsYlhcHCTFtV0zcGV_cMvMfThjfGmFn_yW2lsWEROSPW3v_hxvNn4SUVmRFVr-0Iancme_YhZk0lBwabcXU9K4hED7q5oYCs96tLDCPmDXsXsxwG59jFxbCiQ2qMJkmHd7VpDUCNfUSpUTLhhsfbWcHh994Z2HXi-1RfMS3bQwOI2f1yuiQrFoVLHVbyFoqfXzsRuxNKDCcIfpN8YjGAsvwB8FwveYwk1H7dI3AX8RvlggC9_DJ8XyYcT0MDJIoezpW0UQoK8ChYQHg8z_FTYF5AJLyZVVMksWVgyo0iZHE>\n. \n\n\n\nUnpack the trend  <https://elements.envato.com/learn/chaos-packaging-trend>\n\n\u200a\n\n\n\nStand out on the shelves\n\nExplore more  \n<https://elements.envato.com/graphic-templates/maximalist+packaging+design>\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/high-quality-bottle-packaging-box-mockup-5SJ9L78>\n\nShowcase bold concepts with this Packaging Box Mockup. \n<https://elements.envato.com/high-quality-bottle-packaging-box-mockup-5SJ9L78>\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/toothpaste-tube-mockup-TVCXLQE>\n\nPush your branding further with this Tube Mockup. \n<https://elements.envato.com/toothpaste-tube-mockup-TVCXLQE>\n\n\n\n \n<https://elements.envato.com/high-quality-realistic-soda-tin-can-mockup-K4PGYZK>\n\n \n<https://app.envato.com/graphic-templa",
