        "summary": "\ud83d\udc40 Think you\u2019ve seen it all, Jahan? Meet these new assets",
        "subject": "\ud83d\udc40 Think you\u2019ve seen it all, Jahan? Meet these new assets",
        "details": "More styles. More textures. More ways to win the brief.\n\n\n\n \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \n\u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \n\u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c\n <https://elements.envato.com/>\n <https://elements.envato.com/>\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/all-items>\n \n<https://app.envato.com/shared/workspaces/efe78303-36ff-4d1f-bf50-5f0a92cf4e6f>\n\nMarch\u2019s fresh assets \n<https://app.envato.com/shared/workspaces/efe78303-36ff-4d1f-bf50-5f0a92cf4e6f> \nare live and ready for action!Explore the latest, download what inspires you, \nand turn that spark into something real.\n\nExplore the collection  \n<https://app.envato.com/shared/workspaces/efe78303-36ff-4d1f-bf50-5f0a92cf4e6f>\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/video-templates/sort-by-latest>Video Templates \n<https://elements.envato.com/video-templates/sort-by-latest>\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/lp/ai-videogen/> \n<https://elements.envato.com/lp/ai-videogen/>VideoGen \n<https://elements.envato.com/lp/ai-videogen/> is your built-in AI video tool, \nready when you are. \n\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/ramadan-kareem-eid-mubarak-KZEBDEW>\n\nRamadan <https://elements.envato.com/ramadan-kareem-eid-mubarak-KZEBDEW>\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/black-white-luts-H4V72H6>\n\nBlack & White LUTS <https://elements.envato.com/black-white-luts-H4V72H6>\n\n\n\nNew Video Templates  \n<https://elements.envato.com/video-templates/sort-by-latest>\n\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/graphic-templates/sort-by-latest>Graphic \nTemplates <https://elements.envato.com/graphic-templates/sort-by-latest>\n\nTurn your ideas into studio-ready mockups with our new AI tool: MockupGen. \n<https://labs.envato.com/apps/mockup-gen/>\n\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/high-quality-realistic-notebook-mockup-SWK7CMC>\n\nRealistic Notebook Mockup \n<https://elements.envato.com/high-quality-realistic-notebook-mockup-SWK7CMC>\n\n \n<https://elements.envato.com/high-quality-realistic-mug-mockup-set-for-brandi",
