      {
        "id": "email-20-3",
        "type": "email",
        "date": "2026-02-26",
        "summary": "The VideoGen update that changes everything + a stacked Feb",
        "subject": "The VideoGen update that changes everything + a stacked Feb",
        "details": "\u26a1Sparked: Vol 12\u26a1 Edit AI videos without regenerating, product upgrades, new \ntutorials, and Oscar trends every creative can steal\n\n\n\n \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \n\u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \n\u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c \u200c\n <https://elements.envato.com/>\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/>\n\nVol 12. February 2026\n\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/>\n\n\n\nHello, Jahan!\n\n\n\nFebruary brought the VideoGen update we've been waiting for: you can now edit \nyour AI-generated videos after generating them. Change the lighting, swap a \ncharacter, adapt to any aspect ratio, all while keeping what already works. \nThree new features \u2014Modify, Change Subject, and Reframe \u2014 one massive workflow \nshift.\n\n\n\nBeyond that, the Envato experience got a round of upgrades that make finding \nand licensing assets noticeably faster. We published a stack of new tutorials \non the blog. We broke down what the 2026 Oscar Best Picture nominees reveal \nabout where creative culture is headed. And learnt how to build a fully voiced \nNPC from scratch using Envato's AI tools.\n\n\n\nLet's get into it.\n\n\n\n\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/learn/whats-new-at-envato>What's new \n<https://elements.envato.com/learn/whats-new-at-envato> \n\n\n\n#1: Stop regenerating. Start editing.\n\n <https://elements.envato.com/learn/videogen-edit>\n\nVideoGen's three new editing features end the regeneration spiral. Modify lets \nyou describe changes to an existing generation while preserving composition and \nmotion.Change Subject swaps a character or object via reference image, keeping \neverything else locked. AndReframe adapts a finished video to any of seven \naspect ratios, using your prompts to intelligently fill any new frame space. \nYour generations have value now, and your tools finally help you build on them. \n\nSee how it works  <https://elements.envato.com/learn/videogen-edit>\n\n#2: The Envato experience just got sharper\n\n <https://elements.envat",
        "direction": "inbound",
        "createdAt": "2026-03-16T12:18:59"
      }
