        "details": "Any update or other information you would like to see? Let\u2019s talk soon if\r\navailable!\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\r\nFrom: prasad Achary <prasad@brandiodigital.com>\r\nDate: Fri, Jul 4, 2025 at 8:53\u202fAM\r\nSubject: SHPR June Month SEO and Social Media Reports with comparison\r\nTo: kishan patel <kishanpatel1299@gmail.com>\r\nCC: vinay tallapalli <vinay@brandiodigital.com>\r\n\r\n\r\n*Hello Kishan,*\r\n\r\nGreetings!\r\n\r\nPlease find the June month SEO and Google Ads, social media report. with\r\nthe last 3 months comparison. here is the doc\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1wznqE1tx1q2VehqQObRpqJ0D6Bk870PEB9kvnRiwtB0/edit?usp=sharing\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-- \r\n*Thanks and Regards,*\r\n*Prasad*\r\n*DM Consultant*",
