        "details": "---------- Forwarded message ---------\r\nFrom: prasad Achary <prasad@brandiodigital.com>\r\nDate: Wed, May 28, 2025 at 9:48\u202fAM\r\nSubject: Here is the answers to R$PAWS DM Questions\r\nTo: kishan patel <kishanpatel1299@gmail.com>, <keenankelley1@gmail.com>\r\nCc: vinay tallapalli <vinay@brandiodigital.com>\r\n\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nGood Day,\r\n\r\nhere is the answers to your questions,\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1ApTVi3xhKddx7YWnSE_gZuqgtdx9DoXuBmFwJ5KFsuk/edit?tab=t.0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n*Thanks and Regards,*\r\n*Prasad*\r\n*DM Consultant*",
