        "subject": "Fwd: R4paws website data",
        "details": "This is the requested data. Let me know if you have any questions or need\r\nany more info.\r\n\r\nI have access to the Google ads and fb ads manager so lmk if need me ti\r\npull any more.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nKishan Patel\r\n\r\nOn Wed, May 21, 2025 at 6:03\u202fAM prasad Achary <prasad@brandiodigital.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Hello,\r\n>\r\n> Good Morning.\r\n>\r\n> Regarding the Ideal Customer Profile (ICP)- For campaigns, we focused on\r\n> location-based targeting rather than interest-based filters. We initially\r\n> explored combining both, but the audience became too narrow, which could\r\n> have limited reach and engagement. To ensure more efficient delivery and\r\n> optimal performance, we refined our strategy to target users primarily by\r\n> location.\r\n>\r\n> Reg. customer retention, we implement remarketing campaigns using Meta\r\n> Pixel. This allows us to track potential customers who have previously\r\n> interacted with our website or ads. We then retarget these visitors with\r\n> tailored ads, encouraging them to return and complete their booking or\r\n> engage further with our services.\r\n>\r\n> We track website performance using Google Analytics. Insights\u2014such as\r\n> total visitor numbers, popular pages, time spent on site, and traffic\r\n> sources. Below is the analytics report.\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NlLmtaEiY3uH7ViXNtU89HeKf8--kfqFoZ8SvB9yZfs/edit?gid=0#gid=0\r\n>\r\n> We focus on engagement campaigns to maintain steady brand visibility. By\r\n> leveraging Meta Pixel, we capture user interactions on the platform, which\r\n> enables us to create refined retargeting audiences.\r\n>\r\n> Meta Ads data - https://fb.me/27zm7EWzrcu7R6p\r\n>\r\n> Google Ads data -\r\n> https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1X2btaZTCiJmmsoa8lgJCiGHrLMPVvQ10?usp=sharing\r\n>\r\n> Successful data -\r\n> https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZoM2W1B-m4JTBrYW6mkKiqSu8htmarP3/view?usp=sharing\r\n>\r\n> ---\r\n> *Thanks and Regards,*\r\n> *Prasad*\r\n> *DM Consultant*\r\n>",
