        "details": "Hi Jahan,\r\n\r\nMy name is Rechelle, I am part of the sales team here at Wing. I wanted to\r\npersonally take the time to ask why didn't get the chance of earning your\r\nbusiness.\r\n\r\nWe haven\u2019t heard from you and I understand how busy your days can be. I\r\njust wanted to take the time to reach out to understand what\u2019s keeping you\r\nand your team busy nowadays. If you're open to it, we'd love to jump on a\r\nquick call with you to get some insight on what we could've done better &\r\nunderstand what didn't make the cut.\r\n\r\nWhat would it take to win you back - we'd be happy to talk about more\r\nfavorable pricing.\r\nPlease pick a time here\r\n<https://calendly.com/wing-sales-team/meet-with-wing-sales-team-bluespeak?month=2025-08&date=2025-08-07>\r\nthat\r\nworks best for you. We look forward to reconnecting with you soon!\r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\n*Rechelle May Luberas*\r\n\r\nSales Development Representative\r\nSales | Wing Assistant\r\n+1 (323) 815-7780\r\nrechelle@getwingapp.com\r\nwww.wingassistant.com\r\n[image: facebook] <https://www.facebook.com/wingassistant>\r\n[image: twitter] <https://www.twitter.com/wingassistant>\r\n[image: linkedin] <https://www.linkedin.com/wingassistant>\r\n[image: instagram] <https://www.instagram.com/wingassistant>",
