        "subject": "Payment confirmation from Y-Axis",
        "details": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head>\r\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\r\n  <title>Y-Axis </title>\r\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n  a{\r\n  text-decoration:none;\r\n  color:#000000;\r\n  }\r\n\r\nTry it Yourself \u00c2\u00bb\r\n\r\n/* iPad Text Smoother */\r\ndiv, p, a, li, td { -webkit-text-size-adjust:none; }\r\nbody\r\n{width: 100%;\r\nfont-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\nline-height:20px;\r\nfont-size:13px;\r\ncolor:#000000;\r\n}\r\nhtml\r\n{width: 100%; }\r\nbody {\r\nbackground-color: #ffffff;\r\nmargin: 0px;\r\npadding: 0px;\r\nwidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\nimg {\r\nborder:0px;\r\noutline:none;\r\ntext-decoration:none;\r\ndisplay:block;\r\n}\r\n\r\na img {\r\nborder: none;\r\n}\r\np{\r\nmargin:0 auto;\r\n}\r\nol li{\r\npadding:3px 0;\r\n\r\n\r\n}\r\nol li p{\r\ncolor:#000000;\r\n}\r\n#footer td{\r\ncolor:#ffffff !important;\r\nfont-size:13px;\r\n}\r\ntd img{\r\n    display: block;\r\n    margin-left: auto;\r\n    margin-right: auto;\r\n\r\n}\r\n  </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\r\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"602\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #1a3048;\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"10px\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\r\n<tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\"><img src=\"https://stage.y-axis.com/mailer/sfmails/banner2.jpg \" style=\"display: block;\"></td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"10px\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background: #f5f5f5;\">\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:10px 20px; border-bottom:none\">\r\n<br />\r\n\r\n Dear Jahan Taila,<br><br />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWelcome to Y-Axis. We take the opportunity to inform you of the agreement, our important terms and conditions of the process.\r\n\r\n<br /><br />\r\n\r\n\r\nClient(You) agrees and understands that the association of the client with Y-Axis is governed by a legal agreement that has all the stages of your application process, terms of service deliverables, costs involved and refund clauses(if applicable). It is mandatory for the client to read and sign the agreement upon paying the fees to Y-Axis. Y-Axis will not initiate the service until the client submits the signed agreement to the Y-Axis representative.\r\n<br /><br />\r\n\r\nPlease ensure, if you have read the requirements of your application clearly as per details mentioned in the evaluation report and/or counseling notes provided to you.\r\n\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\r\n<b>Our deliverables:</b>\r\nYou will be assigned a consultant/migration agent soon from our National processing center in Hyderabad for Indian-based clients and respective overseas offices in UAE and Australia, who shall initiate your application process. We will advise on the complete process stage-wise- provide you the document checklist stage-wise and assis",
