"border-collapse: collapse; background: #f5f5f5;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px 20px; border-bottom:none\"> \r\n<br />\r\n\r\n Dear Jahan Taila,<br><br />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAs per our discussion, please find below the payment link for you to initiate the payment and begin the service with us. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\r\nPayment Link: \r\n<a href=\"https://signup.y-axis.com/line_items/new?order_token=PKYYJHHhCkNmbumrYaZp\" style=\"color:#0000FF\">https://signup.y-axis.com/line_items/new?order_token=PKYYJHHhCkNmbumrYaZp  </a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n\r\n \r\nYou are required to click on above link and proceed with the payment. If the transaction is successful, then you will see a confirmation on your screen \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Payment Successful\u00e2\u20ac\ufffd. And you will also receive an email from Y-Axis with the receipt that is auto-generated from our CRM system Salesforce.com.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\r\n \r\nShould you have any questions? please feel free to speak to me.\r\n<br />\r\n\r\n \r\n<br />\r\n\r\nRegards,<br>\r\n\r\n\r\nAbhishek Das<br>Email:abhishek.das@globalindian.com<br>Tel:<br>Extn:1583<br><a href=\"https://www.y-axis.com/lp/visa/referral-program/?pcId=005Vw0000088tqj\" target=\"_blank\">Refer Somebody</a><br>\r\n\r\n\t</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t</tbody></table>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" cel",
