        "summary": "After adding a domain, connect it via your DNS provider:",
        "subject": "After adding a domain, connect it via your DNS provider:",
        "details": "Steps: (Some more documents are attached to help)\r\n\r\n   1. Add CNAME record: www \u2192 base44.onrender.com\r\n   2. Add ANAME/ALIAS record: empty or @ \u2192 base44.onrender.com\r\n   3. If your DNS provider doesn't support ANAME/ALIAS, use A record: @ \u2192\r\n   216.24.57.1\r\n   4. Remove any AAAA records from your domain while configuring DNS. AAAA\r\n   records map to an IPv6 address, and Base44 uses IPv4. These records can\r\n   cause unexpected behavior for your custom domain.\r\n\r\nNote: After adding DNS records, it may take some time for changes to fully\r\npropagate across the internet. During this time, the domain may not work\r\nproperly.\r\n\r\n--",
        "direction": "inbound",
        "createdAt": "2026-03-16T12:18:59"
