        "details": "Hi Jahan! \ud83d\udc4b I'm Cindy Lawrence, a sales assistant at Oxmoor Ford. I understand you're interested in learning more about our financing options and vehicle inventory!The dealership will open at 9AM today, and I'll make sure a sales consultant reaches out to review our lender programs and available vehicles with you. We definitely have great financing options! In the meantime, is there anything specific you'd like to know about? I'm happy to help! \ud83d\ude0a\r\n\r\n\r\nRespectfully, \r\nCindy Lawrence\r\n Oxmoor Ford",
