        "date": "2026-03-06",
        "summary": "Search isn\u2019t just Google anymore",
        "subject": "Search isn\u2019t just Google anymore",
        "details": "Search has changed.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s no longer just Google.\r\n\r\n- 40% of Gen Z now uses TikTok or Instagram for search instead of Google\r\n- YouTube is the second-largest search engine in the world\r\n- Billions of searches are happening inside AI tools like ChatGPT every month\r\n- Over 50% of product discovery starts on social platforms\r\n\r\nSearch isn\u2019t a channel anymore. It\u2019s a behavior.\r\n\r\nYour customers are searching on Google, YouTube, TikTok, Reddit, Amazon, and inside LLMs.\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re only optimizing for traditional SEO, you\u2019re missing huge parts of the journey.\r\n\r\nWinning today requires Search Everywhere Optimization (https://d4GYxT04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/L1+113/d4GYxT04/VVCjmY87L6P3W38XDPH7vyz6XW4Mw1s55LjMTMN2lhp2q7lFdnW95khT26lZ3lHN2p-jN1wH9RPN5p8VF2zh8d4W5RbXKl89D0B7W55hz-l8XDF4GN8G26SX3Kpf8W62xHKq2YD3GKW3XKQP52xXJbGW7rZD537CdVdFN43mCsCkY8DbN4V882CK2dt9W32y5Rn415c2GW9gKhbQ408qKzW2bSX0s2YckxZW5K6g8-8M0rD3W7MrSGx4vnrmlN49bWQ3mS9XNW7sSt2L5qdPkYW9cXN2l9bMS-7W8_-Ph32zrZjfW2M5VfS61Dwm1W7x24ww4Yv7DCW16r6qb5_TMr3W2l9S493V7PrbW3FJ6yB6vGVBTW8HJcVC31yZgdMllPrdwGvHtVDVNHP3pCkr0W4BZpR86R-gZ8N8v9BsYH6LhfW6x1cmr8fZ3G9W2X8rss7Wp81MVyqHcJ5p6NNcW40x6YD5Pnb3rW8JDRcH2RMdn_W8x_XKB42-pJcW84Ddcq3bNLLxW3BKJ9R1rs5gDW5H5lgJ3TXvFBW8-XWmf3Rcfq8W6jmfPp8ZrzxPVqBnbS1B2Dz7W5TvqJw85L7h4V6rkLw1hl_TmVz4Ck56tfBN0W2q7Pv-6fJdtjW7Xcw103Pxnv-VBW3vT2Dxw6KW1RMjPV4rz21nW1s-pLH4ZnjTDW3mbSSK3TRvfbW5_lbVP6sdlFYVl_-Y98CjPshW21DKDl3bs_7YW40x0-w54yNdLVZxnHW8KsRxLW27m_2J2f5v6dW7d1yMW1xjQbWW7TkQxS4n3XvMW67WGc26j188QW3p2bfd1C4n4WN3t7__sb4lGHW2G6fP36fnXf_f8-qYQq04 ) \u2026 not \u201csearch engine optimization\u201d.\r\n\r\n\u2714 Rank in Google\r\n\r\n\u2714 Show up in AI answers\r\n\r\n\u2714 Be discoverable on social search\r\n\r\n\u2714 Build authority that gets cited across platforms\r\n\r\nThe brands that win aren\u2019t optimizing for one algorithm.\r\n\r\nThey\u2019re optimizing for visibility everywhere.\r\n\r\nIf you want to show up everywhere\u2014\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Book a discovery call with NP Digital and let\u2019s future-proof your visibility (https://d4GYxT04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/L1+113/d4GY",
