        "details": "Mobbin logo\r\n\r\nHi there,\r\n\r\nProduct benchmarking is a time-consuming and tedious task. From downloading multiple apps to creating accounts and capturing screenshots manually, it's easy to get overwhelmed.\r\n\r\nAt Mobbin, we're here to streamline this process for you, so that you can benchmark against hundreds of screens in seconds.\r\n\r\nBrowse screens ( www.mobbin.com?utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Tip+%231%3A+Benchmark+hundreds+of+screens+in+seconds&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n\r\nWe wanted to share three of the most popular ways to benchmark with Mobbin:\r\n\r\n1) Screens\r\n\r\n( https://mobbin.com/browse/ios/screens?filter=screenPatterns.Charts&utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Tip+%231%3A+Benchmark+hundreds+of+screens+in+seconds&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n\r\n* Signup ( https://mobbin.com/search/apps/ios?content_type=screens&filter=screenPatterns.Signup&utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Tip+%231%3A+Benchmark+hundreds+of+screens+in+seconds&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n*\r\nSubscription & Paywall ( https://mobbin.com/search/apps/ios?content_type=screens&filter=screenPatterns.Subscription+%26+Paywall&utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Tip+%231%3A+Benchmark+hundreds+of+screens+in+seconds&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n* Dashboard ( https://mobbin.com/search/apps/ios?content_type=screens&filter=screenPatterns.Dashboard&utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Tip+%231%3A+Benchmark+hundreds+of+screens+in+seconds&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n\r\n2) UI elements\r\n\r\n( https://mobbin.com/browse/ios/ui-elements?filter=screenElements.Card&utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Tip+%231%3A+Benchmark+hundreds+of+screens+in+seconds&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n\r\n*\r\nCard ( https://mobbin.com/search/apps/ios?content_type=ui-elements&filter=screenElements.Card&utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Tip+%231",
