        "summary": "Welcome to Mobbin!",
        "subject": "Welcome to Mobbin!",
        "details": "Mobbin logo\r\n\r\nHi there,\r\n\r\nWelcome to Mobbin! We're delighted to have you on board.\r\n\r\nMobbin is a UI and UX reference library of fully searchable mobile and web screenshots. It helps to streamline your product research and benchmarking process.\r\n\r\nHere's what Mobbin can do for you:\r\n\r\n* Gain inspiration from top apps and websites.\r\n* Discover best practices for UI elements, screens, flows, and more.\r\n* Benchmark quickly against your competitors.\r\n\r\nBrowse screens ( www.mobbin.com?utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Welcome+to+Mobbin%21&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n\r\nTo get you started, here's a quick guide.\r\n\r\n1) Find anything with search\r\n\r\nWith our meticulously-tagged screens, you can find exactly what you need in seconds.\r\n\r\n2) Export screens effortlessly\r\n\r\nCopy or download screens as PNG. Put them into your favorite design tool and reference them for your projects.\r\n\r\n3) Create collections and reference later\r\n\r\nOrganize and curate your favorite apps, screens, and flows into collections ( https://mobbin.com/collections?utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Welcome+to+Mobbin%21&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io ). Revist and draw inspiration from the saved items \u2014 whenever you need them.\r\n\r\n( https://mobbin.com/collections?utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Welcome+to+Mobbin%21&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n\r\nThat's all for now. Over the next few days, we're going to share some tips on how you can make the most of Mobbin.\r\n\r\nBrowse screens ( www.mobbin.com?utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Welcome+to+Mobbin%21&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n\r\nThanks so much for joining us,\r\n\r\nJovin\r\n\r\nCo-founder, Mobbin\r\n\r\nP.S. We update our content library every week. If you cannot find what you're looking for, click the \"Request content\" button.\r\n\r\nMobbin logo\r\nMobbin ( https://mobbin.com/?utm_campaign=New+Users+Onboarding&utm_content=Welcome+to+Mobbin%21&utm_med",
