        "summary": "Fw: current subscription status",
        "subject": "Fw: current subscription status",
        "details": "see below\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n----- Forwarded Message -----\r\n\r\nFrom: Louis Archuleta Jr. <louisarchuleta@yahoo.com>\r\nTo: Shawn Edwards <shawne@arrowpos.com>\r\nSent: Monday, March 9, 2026 at 12:21:55 PM PDT\r\nSubject: Re: current subscription status\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks for the response and for taking the time to look into this.\r\n\r\nThis really isn\u2019t about replacing anything with Arrow. My goal is simply to improve our website, SEO, and digital marketing so we can generate more traffic and ultimately drive more online orders through the POS.\r\n\r\nThe company I\u2019m working with focuses specifically on restaurant websites and digital marketing tools such as SEO optimization, retargeting, geofencing campaigns, and database growth. Their role would primarily be helping us attract more customers online and improve the ordering experience from a marketing and design perspective.\r\n\r\nOperationally, I still intend to continue using Arrow POS and Repeat Returns exactly as we do today. In fact, the goal is for this effort to generate more online orders that flow directly through Arrow, allowing us to better utilize the system.\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s why I asked about API access \u2014 simply to allow the website platform to integrate with Arrow so orders can continue flowing into the POS as they currently do.\r\n\r\nI really value our relationship with Arrow and would prefer to continue building on that platform while strengthening our online presence.\r\n\r\nThanks again for your help.\r\n\r\nLouie\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Monday, March 9, 2026 at 10:51:55 AM PDT, Shawn Edwards <shawne@arrowpos.com> wrote: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe can input your SEO analytics to the Arrow online ordering also to help as well. We have done that for multiple customers.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI would like to dive into what it is that drove you looking for this other company to run your online ordering. Can you explain any functionality or design differences that you are looking to gain?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI am trying to get a measure of what you would want to alter about your Arrow website.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
