        "details": "Hello Jahan,\r\nThought this might be relevant \u2014 I helped Veza Agency Network generate 292 opportunities .\r\n\r\nWant me to send it over?\r\n\r\n--\r\nNatalija Ilic\r\nOperations Manager | frontBrick | GTM Agency\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Mon, Mar 9, 2026 at 01:03 PM UTC Natalija Ilic <ilic.natalija@startfrontbrick.com> wrote:\r\nHello Jahan - found you while looking up SEO and content agencies .\r\n\r\nLooks like you don't have a big outbound motion, which usually means new business lives and dies by word of mouth .\r\n\r\nWould you be opposed to a more predictable way to bring in enterprise projects?\r\n\r\nSkale, Finsweet, Veza Digital, Amply and Flowout are landing enterprise projects through a fully personalized ABM program \u2014 without hiring a sales team .\r\n\r\nOpposed to a quick overview?\r\n\r\n--\r\nNatalija Ilic\r\nOperations Manager | frontBrick | GTM Agency",
