        "subject": "your bench",
        "details": "Hey Jahan,\r\n\r\n\r\nIf Derbydigital lost its biggest client tomorrow \u2014 how many discovery calls do you have booked to replace that revenue?\r\n\r\n\r\nFor most agency owners I talk to: zero.\r\n\r\n\r\nThat's not a sales problem. That's a leverage problem. When the pipeline is empty, you can't say no to bad clients, can't raise prices, and can't let your team sit on the bench without bleeding cash.\r\n\r\n\r\nI fix that entirely for you.\r\n\r\n\r\nDone-for-you cold email system built specifically for marketing agencies. I handle everything \u2014 domains, setup, copy, leads \u2014 and book qualified calls directly into your calendar.\r\nYou just show up and close.\r\n\r\nWorth 15 minutes, Jahan?\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2014Daniel\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\nP.S. If you'd rather not hear from me, just reply 'No' and I'll remove you instantly.",
