        "summary": "Your Wikipedia Page Inquiry",
        "subject": "Your Wikipedia Page Inquiry",
        "details": "Hello Jahan,\r\n\r\nHope you are doing well.\r\n\r\nI am reaching out regarding the inquiry you submitted on our website in\r\nNovember about creating a Wikipedia page. The message you submitted was:\r\n\"I'm a young entrepreneur and run Derby Digital, a fast-growing digital\r\nmarketing and software agency where we help brands win the race. Would be\r\ninterested in getting a wikipedia article depending on cost.\".\r\n\r\nApologies for the delayed response. We receive a high volume of requests\r\neach month and work with a limited number of projects at a time. I am\r\nreviewing previous inquiries now, as we have a few slots available this\r\nmonth.\r\n\r\nJust checking whether your Wikipedia page has already been created or if you\r\nare still looking for assistance.\r\n\r\nWe work with an in-house editorial team experienced in Wikipedia's\r\nguidelines, notability requirements, and content policies. If you are still\r\ninterested, please share any independent media coverage or reliable sources\r\nso I can review and assess eligibility.\r\n\r\nWe only take on projects that meet Wikipedia's standards. If a topic is not\r\nyet eligible, we clearly explain why and can guide you on how to become\r\neligible.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nSamson Samuel | Wikipedia Consultant\r\n\r\nEmail: samson.samuel@wikiadvisers.com\r\n<mailto:samson.samuel@wikiadvisers.com> \r\n\r\nWebsite: https://www.wikiadvisers.com/",
