        "summary": "Re: Ask a question about Motion",
        "subject": "Re: Ask a question about Motion",
        "details": "Hi Jahan, Miguel from Motion here. Happy to help! \r\n I understand you\u2019re looking for a lower\u2011price plan as you consider switching from ClickUp and want clarity on our pricing. \r\n I\u2019d like to clarify that the pricing information the bot gave you previously is not accurate for our current plans. Here are the current options with monthly and annual structures: \r\n AI Workplace \r\n - Only annual: $29/mo, includes 1 seat (1,000 credits per month) \r\n AI Employees Starter \r\n - Only annual: $49/mo, includes 1 seat (10,000 credits/month) \r\n AI Employees Light \r\n - Month-to-month: $148/mo for up to 3 seats \r\n- Annual: $99/mo per seat billed annually (25,000 credits/month) \r\n AI Employees Standard \r\n - Month-to-month: $446/mo for up to 10 seats \r\n- Annual: $299/mo per seat billed annually (100,000 credits/month) \r\n AI Employees Plus \r\n - Month-to-month: $894/mo for up to 25 seats \r\n- Annual: $599/mo per seat billed annually (100,000 credits/month) \r\n You can explore these directly from our Pricing page. \r\n Motion offers a 7-day free trial for all new subscribers. Additionally, we offer a reduced rate for your first month. To take advantage of this: \r\n - Go to https://www.usemotion.com/ and create an account. \r\n- During plan selection, choose \u201cANNUAL with reduced first month\u201d from the dropdown menu at the top-right. \r\n- Continue with the regular checkout process. \r\n This option lets you explore Motion with a low upfront cost before the full annual billing begins. \r\n We offer a 25% discount exclusively for undergraduate college/university students and non-profits. To qualify for the student discount, you\u2019ll need to provide one of the following documents: \r\n - A school ID with the current academic year \r\n- Enrollment verification letter \r\n- Official transcript \r\n- Registration confirmation \r\n- Or a letter from your school confirming current enrollment and undergrad status \r\n For non-profits, verification documents confirming nonprofit status are required. Once we review and approve your documents, we can apply the discount to your account. \r\n Let me know if this helps, and if you need anything else! \r\n Cheers, Miguel from Motion \r\n Check out our helpful links here: Help Center |Video Overview | Managing Tasks | Project Views and Reporting | Agenda View | AI-Generated Workflows",
