        "details": "Hi ,\r\n\r\nWas looking at Derby Digital and was really intrigued with how you simplify complex marketing strategies.\u00a0\r\n\r\nI was in the\u00a0neighborhood\u00a0recently and thought I'd\u00a0drop\u00a0you a line!\r\n\r\nI own a local cleaning company here in Louisville, serving businesses like yours with clean, inviting facilities that create lasting first impressions with clients and employees alike.\r\n\r\nIf you're\u00a0interested, I'd\u00a0be\u00a0happy\u00a0to\u00a0provide\u00a0a\u00a0brief, no-obligation\u00a0cleaning estimate\u2014just to\u00a0give\u00a0you\u00a0an idea of\u00a0what we can do.\r\n\r\nLet me know what\u00a0is\u00a0best for you. Looking forward to connecting!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nChris\r\n\r\nChris Hartlage\r\nFranchise Owner\r\nchrishartlage@stratuslouisville.com\r\n\r\n4712 Pinewood Road, Louisville, KY 40218\r\n\r\nIf this isn\u2019t relevant for you, feel free to reply \u201cno\u201d and I won\u2019t reach out again.",
